ions on the following pages.\",\"you-begin-by-learning-the-basic-safety-guidelines\":\"You begin by learning the basic safety guidelines and then practice a few skills under the direct supervision of a PADI Pro. When you’re comfortable, you’ll experience a wonderful adventure underwater.\",next:Pn,try_again:kn,there_is_a_beautiful_unique_world_of_life_to_discover_underwater:$n,underwater_experience_skills_building_blocks:Ln,safety_instructions:Rn,print_save:Nn,forms:On,privacy_policy:Un,consumer_protection:Mn,contact:qn,sign_in:Fn,sign_out:Gn,logbook:Bn,all_your_dives_in_one_place:jn,getting_started:Vn,when_you_start_to_log_dives_during_your_diving_journey_they_will_appear_here:xn,log_training_dive:Hn,log_recreational_dive:Wn,pending:zn,resubmit:Yn,ft:Jn,feet:Kn,minutes:Qn,min:Zn,all:Xn,training:ei,recreational:ti,drafts:oi,draft:ai,general:ni,dive_title:ii,dive_site:si,date:ri,type_of_dive:ci,what_do_you_want_to_call_your_dive:li,where_did_you_dive:di,what_was_the_date_of_your_dive:ui,whats_your_instructors_padi_number:mi,how_did_you_get_in_the_water:pi,add:_i,padi_number:hi,shore:gi,boat:fi,depth_time:yi,time_in:bi,time_out:vi,max_depth:wi,bottom_time:Ai,how_deep_did_you_go:Ei,how_long_was_your_dive:Di,training_dive_skills:Ii,skills:Ti,flexible:Si,flexible_skills:Ci,instructor_determines_skills_timing:Pi,no_flexible_skills_completed_on_this_dive:ki,cramp_removal:$i,tired_diver_tow:Li,inflatable_signal_tubedsmb_deployment:Ri,emergency_weight_drop_or_in_cw:Ni,snorkelregulator_exchange:Oi,removereplace_scuba_surface:Ui,removereplace_weights_surface:Mi,surface_swim_with_compass:qi,underwater_compass_navigation_dive_2_3_or_4:Fi,controlled_emergency_swimming_ascent:Gi,hand_signal_recognition:Bi,equipment_preparation_donning_and_adjustment:ji,predive_safety_check:Vi,entry:xi,buoyancyweight_check:Hi,controlled_descent:Wi,trim_check:zi,partial_mask_flood:Yi,regulator_recoveryclear:Ji,underwater_exploration:Ki,signal_air_supply:Qi,stay_close_to_buddy:Zi,ascent:Xi,exit:es,pl