:NMe,please_enter_name_on_card:FMe,draft:qMe,pending:BMe,resubmit:VMe,verified:HMe,\"2022_padi_member_renewal_pricing_will_be_published_in_fall_2021_youll_have_the_option_to_update_your_renewal_selection_after_pricing_is_published\":\"Το κόστος της ανανέωσης PADI Μέλους για το 2022 θα δημοσιευτεί το Φθινόπωρο του 2021. Θα έχετε την ευκαιρία να ενημερώσετε την επιλογή της ανανέωσης σας αφού δημοσιευτεί το κόστος ανανέωσης.\",file_size_limit:KMe,select_file:UMe,retry_upload:GMe,save:WMe,are_you_sure_you_want_to_delete_this_photo:JMe,delete_photo:YMe,edit_photo:ZMe,completion_date:QMe,reactivate_date:XMe,padi_no:e$e,instructor:a$e,address:t$e,phone:i$e,name:n$e,qualifications:r$e,shop:o$e,savings:s$e,auto_renewal:l$e,auto_renewal_payment_plan:_$e,one_time_renewal:d$e,add_new_user:u$e,username:c$e,first_name:m$e,last_name:g$e,role:p$e,action:h$e,deactivate:f$e,edit:v$e,active:y$e,inactive:b$e,rows_per_page:k$e,password:w$e,email:P$e,optional:S$e,renew_now:A$e,status:C$e,in_progress:z$e,processed:I$e,processing_failed:D$e,participant_name:E$e,forms:j$e,completed:T$e,bulk_process_selected:x$e,download_selected:R$e,participant:M$e,e_learning:$$e,dive_pro:L$e,details:O$e,view:N$e,reload:F$e,text_trouble_loading_data:q$e,showing_pagination_label:B$e,program:V$e,from:H$e,date:K$e,signed:U$e,complete:G$e,all:W$e,new:\"Νέο\",empty_table_text:J$e,limitations:Y$e,birth_date:Z$e,certification_card:Q$e,card_type:X$e,card_back:eLe,format:aLe,padi_club_45_day_trial:tLe,free_trial:iLe,padi_club_membership_includes_exclusive_discounts_on_dive_courses_travel_an_annual_subscription_to_scuba_diving_magazine_and_more_if_you_are_in_the_us_provide_your_shipping_address_to_receive_your_paper_copy_of_the_magazine_customers_outside_the_us_will_receive_the_digital_version_please_note_padi_club_is_currently_available_in_english_only:nLe,membership_includes:rLe,\"20_off_select_padi_e_learning_courses\":\"20% έκπτωση σε επιλεγμένα PADI eLearning Προγράμματα\",annual_subscription_to_scuba_diving_mag