ng_in:lBe,general_and_depth_time:_Be,general_and_training_dive_skills:dBe,depth_time_and_training_dive_skills:uBe,general_depth_time_and_training_dive_skills:cBe,enter_a_max_depth:mBe,enter_a_bottom_time:gBe,buoyancy_control_oral_inflation:pBe,plan_dive_using_slate:hBe,free_descent_without_reference_avoid_contact:fBe,safety_stop:vBe,select_at_least_1_skill:yBe,are_you_ready_to_send_to:bBe,m:kBe,quarry:wBe,cloudy:PBe,what_kind_of_gas_did_you_use:SBe,total_dives:ABe,dive_time:CBe,conditions:zBe,kg:IBe,continue_logging:DBe,instructor_submission:EBe,loading_your_logged_dives:jBe,photos:TBe,what_did_you_see_during_your_dive:xBe,jpg_png_10mb_maximum_per_photo:RBe,assembling_and_positioning_emergency_equipment:MBe,describe_and_record_color_changes_at_depth:$Be,dive_computerdepth_gauge_comparisons:LBe,compass_use_on_land:OBe,distance_swim:NBe,time_estimation_swim:FBe,navigate_a_straight_line_and_its_reciprocal_using_natural_navigation:qBe,navigate_a_straight_line_and_its_reciprocal_using_a_compass:BBe,navigate_a_square_pattern_using_a_compass:VBe,boat_diving_entry:HBe,navigate_from_and_back_to_boat:KBe,deploy_surface_marker_buoy:UBe,boat_diving_exit:GBe,stow_equipment:WBe,camera_system_setup:JBe,still_and_video_imaging:YBe,drift_dive:ZBe,buoyancy_check_with_dry_suit:QBe,neutral_buoyancy:XBe,dry_suit_dive:eVe,scuba_unit_and_weight_system_remove_and_replacement_at_surface:aVe,slate_preparation:tVe,observe_and_identify_fish_families:iVe,record_sightings:nVe,sketchdescribe_unfamiliar_fish:rVe,demonstrate_environmentally_friendly_diving_practices:oVe,use_reference_materials_to_identify_unfamiliar_fish:sVe,effective_communication_and_light_use:lVe,navigation:_Ve,guided_tour:dVe,buoyancy_check:uVe,neutral_buoyancy_during_descent:cVe,hovering:mVe,fine_tune_with_breath_control:gVe,practice_search_patterns_on_land:pVe,practice_object_rigging_on_land:hVe,small_area_search:fVe,large_area_search:vVe,tie_knots_underwater:yVe,rigging_and_lifting_an_object:bVe,identify_aquatic_plant_life:kVe,identify_and_observe_aquatic_invertebrates:wVe,identify_and_observe_aquatic_vertebrates:PVe,log:SVe,knowledge_review:AVe,briefing_tasks_and_planning:CVe,suiting_up:zVe,predive_safety_check_bwraf:IVe,navigating_the_wreck:DVe,returning_to_ascent_point:EVe,ascent__safety_stop:jVe,debrief_self_critique_and_performance_assessment:TVe,log_dive__complete_training_record:xVe,adventure_dive_type:RVe,what_adventure_dive_did_you_complete:MVe,select_adventure_dive:$Ve,dive_type:LVe,training_dive:OVe,select_course:NVe,save_:FVe,dive:qVe,scenario_1___unresponsive_diver_underwater:BVe,search_for_and_locate_a_missing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation_demonstrate:VVe,\"1_interviewing_the_victims_buddy_and_drawing_logical_conclusions_from_the_information_presented\":\"1. Να κάνει ερωτήσεις στο ζευγάρι του θύματος και να βγάλει λογικά συμπεράσματα από τις πληροφορίες που παρουσιάζονται.\",\"2_organizing_a_quick_and_effective_search_using_surface_and_underwater_search_patterns\":\"2. Να οργανώσει μία γρήγορη και αποτελεσματική έρευνα (χρησιμοποιώντας τα μοτίβα έρευνας στην επιφάνεια και υποβρυχίως).\",\"3_searching_for_and_locating_a_missing_diver\":\"3. Να πραγματοποιήσει μία έρευνα και να εντοπίσει έναν αγνοούμενο δύτη.\",\"4_bringing_a_diver_simulating_unresponsiveness_to_the_surface_using_controlled_positive_buoyancy\":\"4. Να μεταφέρει ένα δύτη που προσποιείται ότι δεν ανταποκρίνεται, στην επιφάνεια χρησιμοποιώντας ελεγχόμενη θετική πλευστότητα.\",scenario_2___unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:HVe,demonstrate:KVe,\"1_effectively_responding_to_an_unresponsive_nonbreathing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation\":\"1. Να ανταποκριθεί αποτελεσματικά σε ένα δύτη που δεν ανταποκρίνεται, που δεν αναπνέει κατά την προσομοίωση ατυχήματος.\",\"2_evaluation_tow_inwater_rescue_breathing_removing_equipment_exiting_and_providing_cpr\":\"2. Να αξιολογήσει, να ρυμουλκήσει, να χορηγήσει αναπνοές διάσωσης μέσα στο νερό, να αφαιρέσει τον εξοπλισμό, να βγάλει το δύτη από το νερό και να παράσχει ΚΑΡΠΑ (CPR).\",note_either_use_a_cpr_mannequin_or_simulate_compressions_for_cpr:UVe,exercise_1_tired_diver:GVe,exercise_2_panicked_diver:WVe,exercise_3_response_from_shore_boat_or_dock_responsive_diver:JVe,exercise_4_distressed_diver_underwater:YVe,exercise_5_missing_diver:ZVe,exercise_6_surfacing_the_unresponsive_diver:QVe,exercise_7_unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:XVe,exercise_8_exiting_the_unresponsive_diver:eHe,exercise_9_first_aid_for_pressure_related_injuries_and_oxygen_administration:aHe,exercise_10_response_from_shoreboat_unresponsive_diver:tHe,notifications:iHe,today:nHe,older:rHe,ocean_conservation:oHe,support:sHe,performance:lHe,tools:_He,padi_pro:dHe,padi_club:uHe,discover_scuba_diving:cHe,or:mHe,and:gHe,print:pHe,date_format:hHe,rev:fHe,version:vHe,ecards:yHe,tap_any_card_to_view_details:bHe,you_dont_have_any_ecards_attached_to_your_account_at_this_time:kHe,buy_cert_card:wHe,no_padi_program_found:PHe,take_the_plunge_with_one_of_our_entry_level_programs_for_scuba_diving_freediving_or_mermaid_if_you_think_this_is_a_mistake_please_contact_our_customer_relations_team:SHe,learn_more:AHe,contact_us:CHe,check_out_our_entry_level_courses:zHe,sort_by:IHe,name_a_z:DHe,name_z_a:EHe,most_popular:jHe,price_low_to_high:THe,price_high_to_low:xHe,certifications_with_no_ecards:RHe,no_certifications_found:MHe,no_additional_certifications_without_ecards:$He,view_all:LHe,all_ecards:OHe,assisted_equipment_preparation_donning_and_adjustment:NHe,breathing_and_equalization_techniques:FHe,courses:qHe,total_dive_time:BHe,location:VHe,dive_date:HHe,upload_a_photo:KHe,advanced_open_water:UHe,rescue_diver:GHe,reactivate:WHe,previous:JHe,trimix:YHe,selected_date_outside_range:ZHe,qr_code_verified:QHe,optional_field:XHe,important:eKe,please_make_sure_your_information_is_current_to_update_please_go_to_your:aKe,middle_initial:tKe,ecard_is_included_with_no_additional_fee:iKe,your_instructor_made_a_donation_to_support_conservation_with_a_padi_aware_ecard:nKe,submit_application:rKe,i_agre