,yXe=\"Annual subscription to Scuba Diving magazine\",bXe=\"FREE Reactivate online refresher\",kXe=\"DAN® prepared diver course\",wXe=\"Member credit for PADI Travel®\",PXe=\"Try it for free for 45 days. At the end of the trial period, you decide whether or not to subscribe.\",SXe=\"Promotional Code\",AXe=\"Apply\",CXe=\"Estimated Subtotal\",zXe=\"item\",IXe=\"items\",DXe=\"Promotion\",EXe=\"Estimated Tax\",jXe=\"Taxes calculated at checkout\",TXe=\"Project Aware Donation\",xXe=\"Shipping & Handling\",RXe=\"Unfortunately we are unable to place orders right now. Please try again soon.\",MXe=\"Continue shopping\",$Xe=\"Enter coupon code\",LXe=\"Payment Method\",OXe=\"Credit or Debit card\",NXe=\"Expiration Date (MM / YY)\",FXe=\"of\",qXe=\"Activate\",BXe=\"Secure checkout\",VXe=\"Mobile wallets and major credit cards accepted:\",HXe=\"Pay in Installments\",KXe=\"English\",UXe=\"Primary\",GXe=\"Work\",WXe=\"Mobile\",JXe=\"No\",YXe=\"Jan\",ZXe=\"Feb\",QXe=\"Mar\",XXe=\"Apr\",eea=\"Jun\",aea=\"July\",tea=\"Aug\",iea=\"Sept\",nea=\"Sept\",rea=\"Oct\",oea=\"Nov\",sea=\"Dec\",lea=\"OK\",_ea=\"Submit\",dea=\"Home\",uea=\"Other\",cea=\"Skip\",mea=\"Back\",gea=\"Certification\",pea=\"Plan\",hea=\"Member Number\",fea=\"Search\",vea=\"Store\",yea=\"Account\",bea=\"Certifications & Credentials\",kea=\"No eCard Found\",wea=\"You don't have an eCard attached to this certification\",Pea=\"Replace my physical card\",Sea=\"Purchase eCard\",Aea=\"BIRTHDATE\",Cea=\"QUALIFICATION\",zea=\"Refresh\",Iea=\"PADI Travel\",Dea=\"Settings\",Eea=\"Language\",jea=\"Profile\",Tea=\"Male\",xea=\"City\",Rea=\"State\",Mea=\"Save\",$ea=\"Cancel\",Lea=\"Next\",Oea=\"Try Again\",Nea=\"Contact\",Fea=\"Logbook\",qea=\"All your dives in one place.\",Bea=\"Getting started\",Vea=\"When you start to log dives during your diving journey, they will appear here.\",Hea=\"Log training dive\",Kea=\"Log recreational dive\",Uea=\"ft\",Gea=\"feet\",Wea=\"min\",Jea=\"Training\",Yea=\"Recreational\",Zea=\"Drafts\",Qea=\"General\",Xea=\"Dive Title\",eaa=\"Dive Site\",aaa=\"Type of Dive\",taa=\"What do you want to call your dive?\",iaa=\"Where did you dive?\",naa=\"What was the date of your dive?\",raa=\"What's your instructor's PADI number?\",oaa=\"How did you get in the water?\",saa=\"Add\",laa=\"PADI Number\",_aa=\"Shore\",daa=\"Boat\",uaa=\"Depth/Time\",caa=\"Time in\",maa=\"Time Out\",gaa=\"Max Depth\",paa=\"Bottom Time\",haa=\"How deep did you go?\",faa=\"How long was your dive?\",vaa=\"Training Dive Skills\",yaa=\"Skills\",baa=\"Flexible\",kaa=\"Flexible Skills\",waa=\"Your instructor will determine when you will conduct these skills, depending on dive logistics and conditions.\",Paa=\"No flexible skills completed on this dive\",Saa=\"Cramp removal\",Aaa=\"Tired diver tow\",Caa=\"Inflatable signal tube/DSMB deployment\",zaa=\"Emergency weight drop (or in CW)\",Iaa=\"Snorkel/regulator exchange\",Daa=\"Remove/replace scuba (surface)\",Eaa=\"Remove/replace weights (surface)\",jaa=\"Surface swim with compass\",Taa=\"Underwater compass navigation (Dive 2, 3, or 4)\",xaa=\"Controlled Emergency Swimming Ascent (Dive 2, 3, or 4)\",Raa=\"Hand signal recognition\",Maa=\"Equipment preparation, donning and adjustment\",$aa=\"Predive safety check\",Laa=\"Entry\",Oaa=\"Buoyancy/weight check\",Naa=\"Controlled descent\",Faa=\"Trim check\",qaa=\"Partial mask flood\",Baa=\"Regulator recovery/clear\",Vaa=\"Underwater exploration\",Haa=\"Signal air supply\",Kaa=\"Stay close to buddy\",Uaa=\"Ascent\",Gaa=\"Exit\",Waa=\"Plan dive\",Jaa=\"Entry and weight check\",Yaa=\"Signal turn point\",Zaa=\"Orally inflate BCD (surface)\",Qaa=\"Descent\",Xaa=\"Buoyancy control\",eta=\"Fully flooded mask clearing \",ata=\"Alternate air source use/ascent\",tta=\"Avoid contact\",ita=\"Free descent with visual reference\",nta=\"Mask remove/replace\",rta=\"Water Type\",ota=\"Body of Water\",sta=\"Weather\",lta=\"Temperature\",_ta=\"Air Temperature\",dta=\"Surface Temperature\",uta=\"Bottom Temperature\",cta=\"Visibility\",mta=\"Waves\",gta=\"Current\",pta=\"Surge\",hta=\"What type of water was it?\",fta=\"What body of water did you dive in?\",vta=\"How was the weather?\",yta=\"How was the temp?\",bta=\"What was the air temp?\",kta=\"What was the surface temp?\",wta=\"What was the bottom temp?\",Pta=\"How was the visibility?\",Sta=\"How far could you see?\",Ata=\"How were the waves?\",Cta=\"How was the current?\",zta=\"How was the surge?\",Ita=\"Salt\",Dta=\"Ocean\",Eta=\"Sunny\",jta=\"°F\",Tta=\"°C\",xta=\"High\",Rta=\"None\",Mta=\"Light\",$ta=\"Fresh\",Lta=\"Lake\",Ota=\"Partly Cloudy\",Nta=\"Average\",Fta=\"Small\",qta=\"Low\",Bta=\"Medium\",Vta=\"River\",Hta=\"Rainy\",Kta=\"Large\",Uta=\"Strong\",Gta=\"Windy\",Wta=\"Foggy\",Jta=\"Equipment\",Yta=\"Suit\",Zta=\"Weight\",Qta=\"Additional Gear\",Xta=\"Cylinder\",eia=\"Gas Mixture\",aia=\"Cylinder Pressure\",tia=\"Starting Pressure\",iia=\"Ending Pressure\",nia=\"Amount Used\",ria=\"What suit did you wear?\",oia=\"How was the amount of weight you used?\",sia=\"What other gear did you wear?\",lia=\"What kind of cylinder did you use?\",_ia=\"What was the cylinder size?\",dia=\"Air\",uia=\"PSI\",cia=\"How much did you start with?\",mia=\"How much was remaining?\",gia=\"This will be auto calculated.\",pia=\"lbs\",hia=\"Hood\",fia=\"Steel\",via=\"cu ft\",yia=\"Liters\",bia=\"EANx32\",kia=\"bar\",wia=\"Full Suit 3mm\",Pia=\"Gloves\",Sia=\"Aluminum\",Aia=\"EANx36\",Cia=\"Full Suit 5mm\",zia=\"Good\",Iia=\"Boots\",Dia=\"EANx40\",Eia=\"Full Suit 7mm\",jia=\"Heavy\",Tia=\"Enriched\",xia=\"Shorty\",Ria=\"Semi Dry\",Mia=\"Dry Suit\",$ia=\"Rebreather\",Lia=\"Oxygen\",Oia=\"Nitrogen\",Nia=\"Helium\",Fia=\"Experience\",qia=\"Feeling\",Bia=\"Note\",Via=\"Buddy\",Hia=\"Dive Center\",Kia=\"How did you feel about this dive?\",Uia=\"Write down the memories of your dive\",Gia=\"Who did you go with?\",Wia=\"What dive center did you dive with?\",Jia=\"Amazing\",Yia=\"Poor\",Zia=\"Success!\",Qia=\"Uh Oh!\",Xia=\"You have successfully submitted your dive to your instructor. Check your logbook soon for the status.\",ena=\"An error occurred, and we were unable to publish this dive log.\",ana=\"In the meantime, add additional details to your logged dive before you forget them. This is optional and you can come back and do it any time.\",tna=\"Go to Logbook\",ina=\"Log Dive\",nna=\"Save to Drafts\",rna=\"Submit for Verification\",ona=\"Select course and training dive number\",sna=\"Select Training Dive\",lna=\"Open Water Diver\",_na=\"Open Water Training Dive 1\",dna=\"Open Water Training Dive 2\",una=\"Open Water Training Dive 3\",cna=\"Open Water Training Dive 4\",mna=\"You have logged all training dives for this course.\",gna=\"View all courses\",pna=\"Enter a title\",hna=\"Enter a location\",fna=\"Enter a date\",vna=\"Select a dive type\",yna=\"Enter an instructor\",bna=\"Invalid Instructor Number\",kna=\"Required fields missing in:\",wna=\"General and Depth/Time\",Pna=\"General and Training Dive Skills\",Sna=\"Depth/Time and Training Dive Skills\",Ana=\"General, Depth/Time and Training Dive Skills\",Cna=\"Enter a max depth\",zna=\"Enter a bottom time\",Ina=\"Buoyancy control/Oral inflation\",Dna=\"Plan dive using slate\",Ena=\"Free descent without reference\",jna=\"Safety stop\",Tna=\"Select at least 1 skill\",xna=\"Are you ready to send to\",Rna=\"m\",Mna=\"Quarry\",$na=\"Cloudy\",Lna=\"What kind of gas did you use?\",Ona=\"Total Dives\",Nna=\"Dive Time\",Fna=\"Conditions\",qna=\"kg\",Bna=\"Continue Logging\",Vna=\"Instructor Submission\",Hna=\"Loading your logged dives\",Kna=\"Photos\",Una=\"What did you see during your dive?\",Gna=\"JPG, PNG (10MB maximum per photo)\",Wna=\"Assembling and Positioning Emergency Equipment\",Jna=\"Describe and Record Color Changes at Depth\",Yna=\"Dive Computer/Depth Gauge Comparisons\",Zna=\"Compass Use on Land\",Qna=\"Distance Swim\",Xna=\"Time Estimation Swim\",era=\"Navigate a Straight Line and its Reciprocal Using Natural Navigation\",ara=\"Navigate a Straight Line and its Reciprocal Using a Compass\",tra=\"Navigate a Square Pattern Using a Compass\",ira=\"Boat Diving Entry\",nra=\"Navigate From and Back to Boat\",rra=\"Deploy Surface Marker Buoy\",ora=\"Boat Diving Exit\",sra=\"Stow Equipment\",lra=\"Camera System Setup\",_ra=\"Still and Video Imaging\",dra=\"Drift Dive\",ura=\"Buoyancy Check with Dry Suit\",cra=\"Neutral Buoyancy\",mra=\"Dry Suit Dive\",gra=\"Scuba Unit and Weight System Remove and Replacement at Surface\",pra=\"Slate Preparation\",hra=\"Observe and Identify Fish Families\",fra=\"Record Sightings\",vra=\"Sketch/Describe Unfamiliar Fish\",yra=\"Demonstrate Environmentally Friendly Diving Practices\",bra=\"Use Reference Materials to Identify Unfamiliar Fish\",kra=\"Effective Communication and Light Use\",wra=\"Navigation\",Pra=\"Guided Tour\",Sra=\"Buoyancy Check\",Ara=\"Neutral Buoyancy During Descent\",Cra=\"Hovering\",zra=\"Fine-tune with Breath Control\",Ira=\"Practice Search Patterns on Land\",Dra=\"Practice Object Rigging on Land\",Era=\"Small Area Search\",jra=\"Large Area Search\",Tra=\"Tie Knots Underwater\",xra=\"Rigging and Lifting an Object\",Rra=\"Identify Aquatic Plant Life\",Mra=\"Identify and Observe Aquatic Invertebrates\",$ra=\"Identify and Observe Aquatic Vertebrates\",Lra=\"Log\",Ora=\"Knowledge Review\",Nra=\"Briefing, Tasks and Planning\",Fra=\"Suiting Up\",qra=\"Predive Safety Check (BWRAF)\",Bra=\"Navigating the Wreck\",Vra=\"Returning to Ascent Point\",Hra=\"Ascent – Safety Stop\",Kra=\"Debrief: Self-critique and Performance Assessment\",Ura=\"Log Dive – Complete Training Record\",Gra=\"Adventure Dive Type\",Wra=\"What adventure dive did you complete?\",Jra=\"Select Adventure Dive\",Yra=\"Dive Type\",Zra=\"Training Dive\",Qra=\"Select Course\",Xra=\"Save \",eoa=\"Dive\",aoa=\"Scenario 1 - Unresponsive Diver Underwater\",toa=\"Search for and locate a missing diver during an accident simulation. Demonstrate:\",ioa=\"Scenario 2 - Unresponsive Diver at the Surface\",noa=\"Demonstrate:\",roa=\"Note: Either use a CPR mannequin or simulate compressions for CPR.\",ooa=\"Exercise 1: Tired Diver\",soa=\"Exercise 2: Panicked Diver\",loa=\"Exercise 3: Response from Shore, Boat or Dock (Responsive Diver)\",_oa=\"Exercise 4: Distressed Diver Underwater\",doa=\"Exercise 5: Missing Diver\",uoa=\"Exercise 6: Surfacing the Unresponsive Diver\",coa=\"Exercise 7: Unresponsive Diver at the Surface\",moa=\"Exercise 8: Exiting the Unresponsive Diver\",goa=\"Exercise 9: First Aid for Pressure-related Injuries and Oxygen Administration\",poa=\"Exercise 10: Response from Shore/Boat (Unresponsive Diver)\",hoa=\"Notifications\",foa=\"Today\",voa=\"Older\",yoa=\"Ocean Conservation\",boa=\"Support\",koa=\"Performance\",woa=\"Tools\",Poa=\"PADI Pro\",Soa=\"PADI Club\",Aoa=\"Discover Scuba Diving\",Coa=\"Or\",zoa=\"And\",Ioa=\"Print\",Doa=\"Date (dd/mm/yyyy)\",Eoa=\"Rev\",joa=\"Version\",Toa=\"eCards\",xoa=\"Tap any card to view details\",Roa=\"You don’t have any eCards attached to your account at this time.\",Moa=\"Buy Cert. Card\",$oa=\"No PADI Program Found\",Loa=\"Take the plunge with one of our entry level programs for scuba diving, freediving or mermaid. If you think this is a mistake, please contact our Customer Relations Team.\",Ooa=\"Learn More\",Noa=\"Contact Us\",Foa=\"Check out our entry level courses\",qoa=\"Sort By\",Boa=\"Name(A - Z)\",Voa=\"Name(Z - A)\",Hoa=\"Most Popular\",Koa=\"Price: Low to High\",Uoa=\"Price: High to Low\",Goa=\"Certifications with no eCards\",Woa=\"No Certifications Found\",Joa=\"No additional Certifications without eCards.\",Yoa=\"View All\",Zoa=\"All eCards\",Qoa=\"Assisted equipment preparation, donning and adjustment\",Xoa=\"Breathing and equalization techniques\",esa=\"courses\",asa=\"Total Dive time\",tsa=\"Location\",isa=\"Dive Date\",nsa=\"Upload a photo\",rsa=\"Advanced Open Water\",osa=\"Rescue Diver\",ssa=\"ReActivate\",lsa=\"Previous\",_sa=\"Trimix\",dsa=\"Selected date is outside the allowed range\",usa=\"QR Code Verified\",csa=\"Optional but required if you want a PADI Pro to verify your dive\",msa=\"Important\",gsa=\"Please make sure your information is current.  You <b>must</b> have a photo uploaded to your profile or you will not be able to receive your eCard.  To update your information and upload a current photo, please go to your  <a href='/profile' target='_blank' class='profile-link'>Profile</a>.\",psa=\"Middle Initial\",hsa=\"A PADI eCard<sup>TM</sup> is included with no additional fee.\",fsa=\"Your Instructor made a donation to support conservation with a PADI AWARE eCard<sup>TM</sup>. The donation will go directly to support PADI Dive Centers and Resorts local efforts to keep coral reefs healthy, protect sharks, reduce marine debris and address climate change.\",vsa=\"Submit Application\",ysa=\"I agree this is my signature\",bsa=\"Full Name\",ksa=\"Type your signature\",wsa=\"Draw your signature\",Psa=\"PADI Center\",Ssa=\"Responsible for payment\",Asa=\"Application Fee\",Csa=\"For an additional {currency} 10 you can support conservation with a PADI AWARE eCard<sup>TM</sup>.  The card fee and any additional donation will go directly to support PADI Centers local efforts to keep coral reefs healthy, protect sharks, reduce marine debris and address climate change.\",zsa=\"Optional Additional Donation\",Isa=\"Upgrade to a PADI AWARE eCard\",Dsa=\"donation required\",Esa=\"Application fee paid by\",jsa=\"Note that the application fee covers new member/membership-level processing. Once certified, complimentary membership benefits are extended to the end of this calendar year. To continue your membership next year and onwards, you must renew annually.\",Tsa=\"Sign up for Auto Renewal to ensure no lapse in your membership or benefits and receive the lowest membership rate!\",xsa=\"Yes, sign me up for Auto Renewal. I have read and agree to the\",Rsa=\"PADI Auto Renewal Agreement\",Msa=\"in its entirely\",$sa=\"Saved Payment Method\",Lsa=\"Paid by: \",Osa=\"Signature (or, if a minor, parent/guardian signature required)\",Nsa=\"Signature \",Fsa=\"Prerequisites must be PADI certifications or qualifying certifications from another organization.\",qsa=\"More information\",Bsa=\"You will be required to show proof of certification to your Instructor\",Vsa=\"Certification Completion\",Hsa=\"Course Completion Date\",Ksa=\"Certifying Instructor\",Usa=\"Candidate\",Gsa=\"AWARE eCard Fee\",Wsa=\"PADI AWARE eCard Fee\",Jsa=\"Sign up for Auto Renewal\",Ysa=\"PADI AWARE Donation\",Zsa=\"Credit Card\",Qsa=\"PADI will email you a secure payment link once the application has been processed.\",Xsa=\"Wire transfer\",ela=\"PADI Customer Relations will contact you with wire instructions once the application has been processed.\",ala=\"PayPal\",tla=\"PADI Customer Relations will contact you with PayPal instructions once the application has been processed.\",ila=\"Other payment method\",nla=\"PADI Customer Relations will contact you for further information once the application has been processed.\",rla=\"Please tell us the payment method you are requesting. Do not enter sensitive bank account information. (Maximum 300 characters)\",ola=\"Message\",sla=\"Have logged at least 40 scuba dives\",lla=\"Be medically evaluated and cleared for diving by a physician within the past 12 months\",_la=\"A EFR eCard<sup>TM</sup> is included with no additional fee.\",dla=\"Instructor Agreement\",ula=\"I have obtained the required current EFR Instructor materials and have made myself familiar with the contents.  I understand I cannot conduct any Emergency First Response (EFR) courses until I receive authorization from EFR.  I further agree that when conducting EFR courses I will abide by all EFR Standards and procedures as published and updated by EFR.  I will maintain familiarity with EFR educational materials, including revisions to existing materials and the introduction of new materials.  I affirm that I have read and will abide with the EFR License Agreement found in the Appendix Section of the EFR Instructor Guide.  I understand and agree that any criminal conviction on my part involving abuse of a minor or sexual abuse of an adult, occurring either during or prior to my certification as an EFR Instructor, will be automatic grounds for denial or revocation of my credential.  I also understand EFR may refuse to accept my application or rescind any EFR Instructor credentials I may have if EFR determines my certification is not in the best interest of Emergency First Response.\",cla=\"To enroll in an Emergency First Response Instructor course, an individual must:\",mla=\"Have completed an EFR Primary and Secondary Care course (or qualifying training) within the past 24 months.\",gla=\"Be 18 years old.\",pla=\"Specialty / Distinctive\",hla=\"Specialty or Distinctive\",fla=\"What dive did you complete?\",vla=\"What skills did you complete?\",yla=\"Please make sure your information is current.  To update your information, please go to your <a href='/profile' target='_blank' class='profile-link'>Profile</a>.\",bla=\"The total of all gases must be 100%.\",kla=\"Candidate Information\",wla=\"I have read the <a target='_blank' href='{membershipAgreementLink}'>Membership Agreement and License Agreement</a> and hereby consent and agree to the terms and conditions in their entirety. I understand and agree that any criminal conviction on my part involving abuse of a minor or sexual abuse of an adult occurring either during or prior to my membership with PADI, will be automatic grounds for denial or termination of my PADI Membership. I hereby certify that all the above statements are true and correct to the best of my knowledge.\",Pla=\"I certify that all prerequisites and certification requirements for the EFR Instructor candidate named herein have been met as outlined in the EFR Instructor Trainer Manual.\",Sla=\"I certify that I have obtained, reviewed and confirmed all underlying (prerequisite) course completions for the EFR Instructor candidate named herein. I further confirm that I will permanently retain copies of such required course completions and any other documents obtained as proof of the candidate’s prerequisites having been met for inspection by PADI/EFR, should PADI/EFR so require.\",Ala=\"I certify that the EFR Instructor candidate named herein has purchased a copy of the EFR Instructor training materials, or that this requirement can be waived per EFR Standards.\",Cla=\"I certify that I have obtained, reviewed and confirmed all underlying (prerequisite) certifications for the Divemaster candidate named herein. I further confirm that I will permanently retain copies of such required certifications and any other documents obtained as proof of the candidate's prerequisites having been met for inspection by PADI, should PADI so require.\",zla=\"I certify that all prerequisites and certification requirements for the Divemaster candidate named herein have been met as outlined in the PADI Instructor Manual.\",Ila=\"I certify that the Divemaster candidate named herein has purchased a copy of the PADI Divemaster training materials, or that this requirement can be waived per PADI Standards.\",Dla=\"I verify that the Divemaster candidate named herein has 60 logged dives, documenting experience in night diving, deep diving and underwater navigation.\",Ela=\"Candidate Signature\",jla=\"Payment\",Tla=\"Candidate Prerequisites\",xla=\"Requires proof of certification beyond entry-level (at least two certifications total); proof of 20 or more logged dives; documented experience in deep diving and underwater navigation.\",Rla=\"Requires proof of certification in diving rescue.\",Mla=\"EFR Primary Care requires proof of CPR training within the last 24 months and EFR Secondary Care requires proof of first-aid training within the last 24 months. Online only courses are not acceptable.\",$la=\"To meet CPR and first aid requirements for PADI courses, CPR and first aid training must include student skill practice and demonstration of CPR and first aid techniques with a qualified instructor. A course that lacks these, online or via any other medium, does not qualify.\",Lla=\"Close\",Ola=\"Medical Evaluation\",Nla=\"Minimum Logged Dives\",Fla=\"PADI Emergency First Response Primary and Secondary Care\",qla=\"PADI Advanced Open Water Diver\",Bla=\"PADI Rescue Diver\",Vla=\"EFR eCard\",Hla=\"PADI AWARE eCard\",Kla=\"Instructor Signature\",Ula=\"Certifying Instructor Signature\",Gla=\"PADI eCard\",Wla=\"Be at least 18 years old.\",Jla=\"Have completed Emergency First Response (EFR) Primary & Secondary Care courses (or qualifying courses) within the past 24 months, or, be enrolled in an EFR Primary & Secondary Care course concurrent with this course.\",Yla=\"Have medical clearance attesting to dive fitness signed by a physician within the previous 12 months, and have no medical condition changes.\",Zla=\"I have read the  <a target='_blank' href='{membershipAgreementLink}'>Snorkel Guide Membership Agreement</a> and hereby consent and agree to the terms and conditions in their entirety.  I understand and agree that any criminal conviction on my part involving abuse of a minor or sexual abuse of an adult occurring either during or prior to my Membership with PADI, may be grounds for denial or termination of my PADI Membership.  I hereby certify that all the above statements are true and correct to the best of my knowledge.\",Qla=\"I certify that all prerequisties and certification requirements for the Snorkel Guide Candidate named herein have been met as outlined in the Snorkel Guide Course Instructor Guide.\",Xla=\"I certify that I have obtained, reviewed and confirmed all underlying (prerequisite) certifications for the Snorkel Guide candidate named herein.  I further confirm that I will permanently retain copies of such required certifications and any other documents obtained as proof of the candidates prerequisites having been met for inspection by PADI, should PADI therefore require.\",e_a=\"I certify that the Snorkel Guide candidate named herein has been provided with the PADI Snorkel Guide Course Notes, including Snorkel Briefi­ng Guidelines.\",a_a={update:$Ue,remove:LUe,mark_as_read:OUe,Delete:NUe,january:FUe,february:qUe,march:BUe,april:VUe,may:HUe,june:KUe,july:UUe,august:GUe,september:WUe,october:JUe,november:YUe,december:ZUe,day:QUe,month:XUe,year:eGe,afghanistan:aGe,aland_islands:tGe,albania:iGe,algeria:nGe,americanSamoa:rGe,andorra:oGe,angola:sGe,anguilla:lGe,antarctica:_Ge,antigua_and_barbuda:dGe,argentina:uGe,armenia:cGe,aruba:mGe,australia:gGe,austria:pGe,azerbaijan:hGe,bahamas:fGe,bahrain:vGe,bangladesh:yGe,barbados:bGe,belarus:kGe,belgium:wGe,belize:PGe,benin:SGe,bermuda:AGe,bhutan:CGe,bolivia_plurinational_state_of:zGe,bosnia_and_herzegovina:IGe,botswana:DGe,brazil:EGe,british_indian_ocean_territory:jGe,brunei_darussalam:TGe,bulgaria:xGe,burkina_faso:RGe,burundi:MGe,cambodia:$Ge,cameroon:LGe,canada:OGe,cape_verde:NGe,cayman_islands:FGe,central_african_republic:qGe,chad:BGe,chile:VGe,china:HGe,christmas_island:KGe,cocos_keeling_islands:UGe,colombia:GGe,comoros:WGe,congo:JGe,congo_the_democratic_republic_of_the_congo:YGe,cook_islands:ZGe,costa_rica:QGe,cote_divoire:XGe,croatia:eWe,cuba:aWe,cyprus:tWe,czech_republic:iWe,denmark:nWe,djibouti:rWe,dominica:oWe,dominican_republic:sWe,ecuador:lWe,egypt:_We,el_salvador:dWe,equatorial_guinea:uWe,eritrea:cWe,estonia:mWe,ethiopia:gWe,falkland_islands_malvinas:pWe,faroe_islands:hWe,fiji:fWe,finland:vWe,france:yWe,french_guiana:bWe,french_polynesia:kWe,gabon:wWe,gambia:PWe,georgia:SWe,germany:AWe,ghana:CWe,gibraltar:zWe,greece:IWe,greenland:DWe,grenada:EWe,guadeloupe:jWe,guam:TWe,guatemala:xWe,guernsey:RWe,guinea:MWe,guinea_bissau:$We,guyana:LWe,haiti:OWe,holy_see_vatican_city_state:NWe,honduras:FWe,hong_kong:qWe,hungary:BWe,iceland:VWe,india:HWe,indonesia:KWe,iran_islamic_republic_of_persian_gulf:UWe,iraq:GWe,ireland:WWe,isle_of_man:JWe,israel:YWe,italy:ZWe,jamaica:QWe,japan:XWe,jersey:eJe,jordan:aJe,k