nti, hinaus, puhalluselvytys vedessä, varusteiden riisuminen, vedestä poistuminen ja painelu-puhalluselvytys.\",note_either_use_a_cpr_mannequin_or_simulate_compressions_for_cpr:OIa,exercise_1_tired_diver:NIa,exercise_2_panicked_diver:FIa,exercise_3_response_from_shore_boat_or_dock_responsive_diver:qIa,exercise_4_distressed_diver_underwater:BIa,exercise_5_missing_diver:VIa,exercise_6_surfacing_the_unresponsive_diver:HIa,exercise_7_unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:KIa,exercise_8_exiting_the_unresponsive_diver:UIa,exercise_9_first_aid_for_pressure_related_injuries_and_oxygen_administration:GIa,exercise_10_response_from_shoreboat_unresponsive_diver:WIa,notifications:JIa,today:YIa,older:ZIa,ocean_conservation:QIa,support:XIa,performance:eDa,tools:aDa,padi_pro:tDa,padi_club:iDa,discover_scuba_diving:nDa,or:rDa,and:oDa,print:sDa,date_format:lDa,rev:_Da,version:dDa,ecards:uDa,tap_any_card_to_view_details:cDa,you_dont_have_any_ecards_attached_to_your_account_at_this_time:mDa,buy_cert_card:gDa,no_padi_program_found:pDa,take_the_plunge_with_one_of_our_entry_level_programs_for_scuba_diving_freediving_or_mermaid_if_you_think_this_is_a_mistake_please_contact_our_customer_relations_team:hDa,learn_more:fDa,contact_us:vDa,check_out_our_entry_level_courses:yDa,sort_by:bDa,name_a_z:kDa,name_z_a:wDa,most_popular:PDa,price_low_to_high:SDa,price_high_to_low:ADa,certifications_with_no_ecards:CDa,no_certifications_found:zDa,no_additional_certifications_without_ecards:IDa,view_all:DDa,all_ecards:EDa,assisted_equipment_preparation_donning_and_adjustment:jDa,breathing_and_equalization_techniques:TDa,courses:xDa,total_dive_time:RDa,location:MDa,dive_date:$Da,upload_a_photo:LDa,advanced_open_water:ODa,rescue_diver:NDa,reactivate:FDa,previous:qDa,trimix:BDa,selected_date_outside_range:VDa,qr_code_verified:HDa,optional_field:KDa,important:UDa,please_make_sure_your_information_is_current_to_update_please_go_to_your:GDa,middle_initial:WDa,ecard_is_included_with_no_additional_fee:JDa,your_instructo