usive_discounts_on_dive_courses_travel_an_annual_subscription_to_scuba_diving_magazine_and_more_if_you_are_in_the_us_provide_your_shipping_address_to_receive_your_paper_copy_of_the_magazine_customers_outside_the_us_will_receive_the_digital_version_please_note_padi_club_is_currently_available_in_english_only:_Oa,membership_includes:dOa,\"20_off_select_padi_e_learning_courses\":\"20 % de réduction sur une sélection de cours PADI eLearning\",annual_subscription_to_scuba_diving_magazine:uOa,\"5_of_your_membership_fee_supports_ocean_conservation_efforts_around_the_globe\":\"5 % de votre cotisation soutiennent les efforts de conservation de l'océan dans le monde entier\",free_reactivate_online_refresher:cOa,dan_prepared_diver_course:mOa,\"20_off_padi_merchandise\":\"20% de réduction sur les produits PADI™\",member_credit_for_padi_travel:gOa,\"20_off_sea_life_i_phone_underwater_housing\":\"20% de réduction sur le caisson sous-marin SeaLife® pour iPhone\",try_it_for_free_for_45_days_at_the_end_of_the_trial_period_you_decide_whether_or_not_to_subscribe:pOa,promotional_code:hOa,apply:fOa,estimated_subtotal:vOa,item:yOa,items:bOa,promotion:kOa,estimated_tax:wOa,tax_calculated_at_checkout:POa,project_aware_donation:SOa,shipping_handling:AOa,unfortunately_we_are_unable_to_place_orders_right_now_please_try_again_soon:COa,continue_shopping:zOa,enter_coupon_code:IOa,payment_method:DOa,credit_or_debit_card:EOa,expiration_date:jOa,of:TOa,activate:xOa,secure_checkout:ROa,cart_payment_methods_text:MOa,pay_in_installments:$Oa,english:LOa,primary:OOa,work:NOa,mobile:FOa,no:qOa,jan:BOa,feb:VOa,mar:HOa,apr:KOa,jun:UOa,jul:GOa,aug:WOa,sep:JOa,sept:YOa,oct:ZOa,nov:QOa,dec:XOa,ok:eNa,submit:aNa,home:tNa,other:iNa,skip:nNa,back:rNa,certification:oNa,plan:sNa,member_number:lNa,search:_Na,store:dNa,account:uNa,certifications_credentials:cNa,no_ecard_found:mNa,you_dont_have_an_ecard_attached_to_this_certification:gNa,replace_my_physical_card:pNa,purchase_ecard:hNa,birthdate:fNa,qualification:vNa,