unfamiliar_fish:dHa,demonstrate_environmentally_friendly_diving_practices:uHa,use_reference_materials_to_identify_unfamiliar_fish:cHa,effective_communication_and_light_use:mHa,navigation:gHa,guided_tour:pHa,buoyancy_check:hHa,neutral_buoyancy_during_descent:fHa,hovering:vHa,fine_tune_with_breath_control:yHa,practice_search_patterns_on_land:bHa,practice_object_rigging_on_land:kHa,small_area_search:wHa,large_area_search:PHa,tie_knots_underwater:SHa,rigging_and_lifting_an_object:AHa,identify_aquatic_plant_life:CHa,identify_and_observe_aquatic_invertebrates:zHa,identify_and_observe_aquatic_vertebrates:IHa,log:DHa,knowledge_review:EHa,briefing_tasks_and_planning:jHa,suiting_up:THa,predive_safety_check_bwraf:xHa,navigating_the_wreck:RHa,returning_to_ascent_point:MHa,ascent__safety_stop:$Ha,debrief_self_critique_and_performance_assessment:LHa,log_dive__complete_training_record:OHa,adventure_dive_type:NHa,what_adventure_dive_did_you_complete:FHa,select_adventure_dive:qHa,dive_type:BHa,training_dive:VHa,select_course:HHa,save_:KHa,dive:UHa,scenario_1___unresponsive_diver_underwater:GHa,search_for_and_locate_a_missing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation_demonstrate:WHa,\"1_interviewing_the_victims_buddy_and_drawing_logical_conclusions_from_the_information_presented\":\"1. Interroger le binôme de la victime et établir les conclusions logiques à partir des informations présentées.\",\"2_organizing_a_quick_and_effective_search_using_surface_and_underwater_search_patterns\":\"2. Organiser une recherche rapide et efficace (en utilisant des schémas de recherche en surface et sous l’eau).\",\"3_searching_for_and_locating_a_missing_diver\":\"3. Faire une recherche et localiser un plongeur manquant.\",\"4_bringing_a_diver_simulating_unresponsiveness_to_the_surface_using_controlled_positive_buoyancy\":\"4. Remonter en surface un plongeur qui simule l’inconscience en effectuant une remontée contrôlée en flottabilité positive.\",scenario_2___unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:JHa,demonstrate:YHa,\"1_effectively_responding_to_an_unresponsive_nonbreathing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation\":\"1. Réagir efficacement face à un plongeur inconscient qui ne respire pas, lors d’un accident simulé.\",\"2_evaluation_tow_inwater_rescue_breathing_removing_equipment_exiting_and_providing_cpr\":\"2. Faire l’évaluation, le tractage, des insufflations dans l’eau, le déséquipement, la sortie et l’administration de la RCP.\",note_either_use_a_cpr_mannequin_or_simulate_compressions_for_cpr:ZHa,exercise_1_tired_diver:QHa,exercise_2_panicked_diver:XHa,exercise_3_response_from_shore_boat_or_dock_responsive_diver:eKa,exercise_4_distressed_diver_underwater:aKa,exercise_5_missing_diver:tKa,exercise_6_surfacing_the_unresponsive_diver:iKa,exercise_7_unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:nKa,exercise_8_exiting_the_unresponsive_diver:rKa,exercise_9_first_aid_for_pressure_related_injuries_and_oxygen_administration:oKa,exercise_10_response_from_shoreboat_unresponsive_diver:sKa,notifications:lKa,today:_Ka,older:dKa,ocean_conservation:uKa,support:cKa,performance:mKa,tools:gKa,padi_pro:pKa,padi_club:hKa,discover_scuba_diving:fKa,or:vKa,and:yKa,print:bKa,date_format:kKa,rev:wKa,version:PKa,ecards:SKa,tap_any_card_to_view_details:AKa,you_dont_have_any_ecards_attached_to_your_account_at_this_time:CKa,buy_cert_card:zKa,no_padi_program_found:IKa,take_the_plunge_with_one_of_our_entry_level_programs_for_scuba_diving_freediving_or_mermaid_if_you_think_this_is_a_mistake_please_contact_our_customer_relations_team:DKa,learn_more:EKa,contact_us:jKa,check_out_our_entry_level_courses:TKa,sort_by:xKa,name_a_z:RKa,name_z_a:MKa,most_popular:$Ka,price_low_to_high:LKa,price_high_to_low:OKa,certifications_with_no_ecards:NKa,no_certifications_found:FKa,no_additional_certifications_without_ecards:qKa,view_all:BKa,all_ecards:VKa,assisted_equipment_preparation_donning_and_adjustment:HKa,breathing_and_equalization_techniques:KKa,courses:UKa,total_dive_time:GKa,location:WKa,dive_date:JKa,upload_a_photo:YKa,adv