inkovito traženje ( korištenjem površinskih i podvodnih modela pretraživanja).\",\"3_searching_for_and_locating_a_missing_diver\":\"3. Pretraživanje i lociranje nestalog ronioca.\",\"4_bringing_a_diver_simulating_unresponsiveness_to_the_surface_using_controlled_positive_buoyancy\":\"4. Izranjanje do površine s roniocem koji simulira nereagiranje s kontroliranom pozitivnom plovnošću.\",scenario_2___unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:dst,demonstrate:ust,\"1_effectively_responding_to_an_unresponsive_nonbreathing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation\":\"1. Učinkovito odgovaranje na ronioca koji tijekom simuliranja nesreće ne reagira i ne diše.\",\"2_evaluation_tow_inwater_rescue_breathing_removing_equipment_exiting_and_providing_cpr\":\"2. Procjena, tegljenje, umjetno disanje u vodi, uklanjanje opreme, izlazak i izvođenje OSP.\\n\\n\",note_either_use_a_cpr_mannequin_or_simulate_compressions_for_cpr:cst,exercise_1_tired_diver:mst,exercise_2_panicked_diver:gst,exercise_3_response_from_shore_boat_or_dock_responsive_diver:pst,exercise_4_distressed_diver_underwater:hst,exercise_5_missing_diver:fst,exercise_6_surfacing_the_unresponsive_diver:vst,exercise_7_unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:yst,exercise_8_exiting_the_unresponsive_diver:bst,exercise_9_first_aid_for_pressure_related_injuries_and_oxygen_administration:kst,exercise_10_response_from_shoreboat_unresponsive_diver:wst,notifications:Pst,today:Sst,older:Ast,ocean_conservation:Cst,support:zst,performance:Ist,tools:Dst,padi_pro:Est,padi_club:jst,discover_scuba_diving:Tst,or:xst,and:Rst,print:Mst,date_format:$st,rev:Lst,version:Ost,ecards:Nst,tap_any_card_to_view_details:Fst,you_dont_have_any_ecards_attached_to_your_account_at_this_time:qst,buy_cert_card:Bst,no_padi_program_found:Vst,take_the_plunge_with_one_of_our_entry_level_programs_for_scuba_diving_freediving_or_mermaid_if_you_think_this_is_a_mistake_please_contact_our_customer_relations_team:Hst,learn_more:Kst,contact_us:Ust,check_out_our_entry_level_courses:Gst,sort_by