e_and_performance_assessment:sIt,log_dive__complete_training_record:lIt,adventure_dive_type:_It,what_adventure_dive_did_you_complete:dIt,select_adventure_dive:uIt,dive_type:cIt,training_dive:mIt,select_course:gIt,save_:pIt,dive:hIt,scenario_1___unresponsive_diver_underwater:fIt,search_for_and_locate_a_missing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation_demonstrate:vIt,\"1_interviewing_the_victims_buddy_and_drawing_logical_conclusions_from_the_information_presented\":\"1. Mewawancarai buddy korban dan membuat kesimpulan logis dari informasi yang diberikan.\",\"2_organizing_a_quick_and_effective_search_using_surface_and_underwater_search_patterns\":\"2. Mengorganisir pencarian yang cepat dan efektif (menggunakan pola pencarian di permukaan dan di bawah air).\",\"3_searching_for_and_locating_a_missing_diver\":\"3. Mencari dan menemukan penyelam yang hilang.\",\"4_bringing_a_diver_simulating_unresponsiveness_to_the_surface_using_controlled_positive_buoyancy\":\"4. Membawa penyelam yang mensimulasikan ketidaktanggapan ke permukaan menggunakan daya apung positif yang terkontrol.\",scenario_2___unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:yIt,demonstrate:bIt,\"1_effectively_responding_to_an_unresponsive_nonbreathing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation\":\"1. Merespon secara efektif terhadap penyelam yang tidak responsif dan tidak bernapas saat simulasi kecelakaan.\",\"2_evaluation_tow_inwater_rescue_breathing_removing_equipment_exiting_and_providing_cpr\":\"2. Mengevaluasi, menarik, memberi bantuan pernapasan di air, melepaskan peralatan, mengeluarkan dan memberikan CPR.\",note_either_use_a_cpr_mannequin_or_simulate_compressions_for_cpr:kIt,exercise_1_tired_diver:wIt,exercise_2_panicked_diver:PIt,exercise_3_response_from_shore_boat_or_dock_responsive_diver:SIt,exercise_4_distressed_diver_underwater:AIt,exercise_5_missing_diver:CIt,exercise_6_surfacing_the_unresponsive_diver:zIt,exercise_7_unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:IIt,exercise_8_exiting_the_unresponsive_diver:DIt,exercise_9_first_aid_for_pressure_related_injuries_and_oxygen_administration:EIt,exercise_10_response_from_shoreboat_unresponsive_diver:jIt,notifications:TIt,today:xIt,older:RIt,ocean_conservation:MIt,support:$It,performance:LIt,tools:OIt,padi_pro:NIt,shop:FIt,padi_club:qIt,discover_scuba_diving:BIt,or:VIt,and:HIt,participant_name:KIt,print:UIt,date_format:GIt,rev:WIt,version:JIt,ecards:YIt,tap_any_card_to_view_details:ZIt,you_dont_have_any_ecards_attached_to_your_account_at_this_time:QIt,buy_cert_card:XIt,no_padi_program_found:eDt,take_the_plunge_with_one_of_our_entry_level_programs_for_scuba_diving_freediving_or_mermaid_if_you_think_this_is_a_mistake_please_contact_our_customer_relations_team:aDt,learn_more:tDt,contact_us:iDt,check_out_our_entry_level_courses:nDt,sort_by:rDt,name_a_z:oDt,name_z_a:sDt,most_popular:lDt,price_low_to_high:_Dt,price_high_to_low:dDt,certifications_with_no_ecards:uDt,no_certifications_found:cDt,no_additional_certifications_without_ecards:mDt,view_all:gDt,all_ecards:pDt,assisted_equipment_preparation_donning_and_adjustment:hDt,breathing_and_equalization_techniques:fDt,courses:vDt,total_dive_time:yDt,location:bDt,dive_date:kDt,upload_a_photo:wDt,previous:PDt,qr_code_verified:SDt,\"pagination.showing_range_of_total\":\"Menampilkan {range_start}-{range_end} dari {total}\"},CDt=\"Aggiorna\",zDt=\"Cancella\",IDt=\"Segna come letta\",DDt=\"Elimina\",EDt=\"Gennaio\",jDt=\"Febbraio\",TDt=\"Marzo\",xDt=\"Aprile\",RDt=\"Maggio\",MDt=\"Giugno\",$Dt=\"Luglio\",LDt=\"Agosto\",ODt=\"Settembre\",NDt=\"Ottobre\",FDt=\"Novembre\",qDt=\"Dicembre\",BDt=\"Giorno\",VDt=\"Mese\",HDt=\"Anno\",KDt=\"Afghanistan\",UDt=\"Isole Aland,\",GDt=\"Albania\",WDt=\"Algeria\",JDt=\"Samoa Americane\",YDt=\"Andorra\",ZDt=\"Angola\",QDt=\"Anguilla\",XDt=\"Antartide\",eEt=\"Antigua e Barbuda\",aEt=\"Argentina\",tEt=\"Armenia\",iEt=\"Aruba\",nEt=\"Australia\",rEt=\"Austria\",oEt=\"Azerbaigian\",sEt=\"Bahamas\",lEt=\"Bahrain\",_Et=\"Bangladesh\",dEt=\"Barbados\",uEt=\"Bielorussia\",cEt=\"Belgio\",m