ng_the_wreck:TBt,returning_to_ascent_point:xBt,ascent__safety_stop:RBt,debrief_self_critique_and_performance_assessment:MBt,log_dive__complete_training_record:$Bt,adventure_dive_type:LBt,what_adventure_dive_did_you_complete:OBt,select_adventure_dive:NBt,dive_type:FBt,training_dive:qBt,select_course:BBt,save_:VBt,dive:HBt,scenario_1___unresponsive_diver_underwater:KBt,search_for_and_locate_a_missing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation_demonstrate:UBt,\"1_interviewing_the_victims_buddy_and_drawing_logical_conclusions_from_the_information_presented\":\"1. Interrogare il compagno della vittima e trarre logiche conclusioni dalle informazioni ricevute.\",\"2_organizing_a_quick_and_effective_search_using_surface_and_underwater_search_patterns\":\"2. Organizzare una ricerca rapida ed efficace (usando metodi di ricerca in superficie e sott’acqua).\",\"3_searching_for_and_locating_a_missing_diver\":\"3. Cercare e trovare un subacqueo disperso.\",\"4_bringing_a_diver_simulating_unresponsiveness_to_the_surface_using_controlled_positive_buoyancy\":\"4. Portare in superficie un subacqueo che simula di essere incosciente usando il controllo dell’assetto positivo.\",scenario_2___unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:GBt,demonstrate:WBt,\"1_effectively_responding_to_an_unresponsive_nonbreathing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation\":\"1. Soccorrere efficacemente un subacqueo incosciente, che non respira, durante un incidente simulato.\",\"2_evaluation_tow_inwater_rescue_breathing_removing_equipment_exiting_and_providing_cpr\":\"2. Valutarlo, trainarlo, fargli la respirazione artificiale in acqua, rimuovergli l’attrezzatura, farlo uscire dall’acqua e fargli la RCP.\",note_either_use_a_cpr_mannequin_or_simulate_compressions_for_cpr:JBt,exercise_1_tired_diver:YBt,exercise_2_panicked_diver:ZBt,exercise_3_response_from_shore_boat_or_dock_responsive_diver:QBt,exercise_4_distressed_diver_underwater:XBt,exercise_5_missing_diver:eVt,exercise_6_surfacing_the_unresponsive_diver:aVt,exercise_7_unres