_and_positioning_emergency_equipment:UPi,describe_and_record_color_changes_at_depth:GPi,dive_computerdepth_gauge_comparisons:WPi,compass_use_on_land:JPi,distance_swim:YPi,time_estimation_swim:ZPi,navigate_a_straight_line_and_its_reciprocal_using_natural_navigation:QPi,navigate_a_straight_line_and_its_reciprocal_using_a_compass:XPi,navigate_a_square_pattern_using_a_compass:eSi,boat_diving_entry:aSi,navigate_from_and_back_to_boat:tSi,deploy_surface_marker_buoy:iSi,boat_diving_exit:nSi,stow_equipment:rSi,camera_system_setup:oSi,still_and_video_imaging:sSi,drift_dive:lSi,buoyancy_check_with_dry_suit:_Si,neutral_buoyancy:dSi,dry_suit_dive:uSi,scuba_unit_and_weight_system_remove_and_replacement_at_surface:cSi,slate_preparation:mSi,observe_and_identify_fish_families:gSi,record_sightings:pSi,sketchdescribe_unfamiliar_fish:hSi,demonstrate_environmentally_friendly_diving_practices:fSi,use_reference_materials_to_identify_unfamiliar_fish:vSi,effective_communication_and_light_use:ySi,navigation:bSi,guided_tour:kSi,buoyancy_check:wSi,neutral_buoyancy_during_descent:PSi,hovering:SSi,fine_tune_with_breath_control:ASi,practice_search_patterns_on_land:CSi,practice_object_rigging_on_land:zSi,small_area_search:ISi,large_area_search:DSi,tie_knots_underwater:ESi,rigging_and_lifting_an_object:jSi,identify_aquatic_plant_life:TSi,identify_and_observe_aquatic_invertebrates:xSi,identify_and_observe_aquatic_vertebrates:RSi,log:MSi,knowledge_review:$Si,briefing_tasks_and_planning:LSi,suiting_up:OSi,predive_safety_check_bwraf:NSi,navigating_the_wreck:FSi,returning_to_ascent_point:qSi,ascent__safety_stop:BSi,debrief_self_critique_and_performance_assessment:VSi,log_dive__complete_training_record:HSi,adventure_dive_type:KSi,what_adventure_dive_did_you_complete:USi,select_adventure_dive:GSi,dive_type:WSi,training_dive:JSi,select_course:YSi,save_:ZSi,dive:QSi,scenario_1___unresponsive_diver_underwater:XSi,search_for_and_locate_a_missing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation_demonstrate:eAi,\"1_interviewing_the_victims_buddy_and_drawing_logical_conclusions_from_the_information_presented\":\"1. 조난자의 버디를 인터뷰하고, 주어진 정보를 바탕으로 논리적인 결론 내리기.\",\"2_organizing_a_quick_and_effective_search_using_surface_and_underwater_search_patterns\":\"2. 빠르고 효과적인 수색 (수면 및 수중 수색 패턴을 사용하여)을 조직하기.\",\"3_searching_for_and_locating_a_missing_diver\":\"3. 실종된 다이버를 수색하고 위치 찾기.\",\"4_bringing_a_diver_simulating_unresponsiveness_to_the_surface_using_controlled_positive_buoyancy\":\"4. 의식이 없는 것을 가장한 다이버를 조절된 양성 부력을 사용하여 수면으로 데리고 오기.\",scenario_2___unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:aAi,demonstrate:tAi,\"1_effectively_responding_to_an_unresponsive_nonbreathing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation\":\"1. 사고를 연출하는 동안 의식이 없고, 호흡하지 않는 다이버에 효과적으로 대응하기.\",\"2_evaluation_tow_inwater_rescue_breathing_removing_equipment_exiting_and_providing_cpr\":\"2. 상황을 평가하고, 다이버를 끌면서 물 위에서 구조 호흡을 제공하고, 장비를 제거하며, 출수하여 CPR 제공하기.\",note_either_use_a_cpr_mannequin_or_simulate_compressions_for_cpr:iAi,exercise_1_tired_diver:nAi,exercise_2_panicked_diver:rAi,exercise_3_response_from_shore_boat_or_dock_responsive_diver:oAi,exercise_4_distressed_diver_underwater:sAi,exercise_5_missing_diver:lAi,exercise_6_surfacing_the_unresponsive_diver:_Ai,exercise_7_unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:dAi,exercise_8_exiting_the_unresponsive_diver:uAi,exercise_9_first_aid_for_pressure_related_injuries_and_oxygen_administration:cAi,exercise_10_response_from_shoreboat_unresponsive_diver:mAi,notifications:gAi,today:pAi,older:hAi,ocean_conservation:fAi,support:vAi,performance:yAi,tools:bAi,padi_pro:kAi,padi_club:wAi,discover_scuba_diving:PAi,or:SAi,and:AAi,print:CAi,date_format:zAi,rev:IAi,version:DAi,ecards:EAi,tap_any_card_to_view_details:jAi,you_dont_have_any_ecards_attached_to_your_account_at_this_time:TAi,buy_cert_card:xAi,no_padi_program_found:RAi,take_the_plunge_with_one_of_our_entry_level_programs_for_scuba_diving_freediving_or_mermaid_if_you_think_this_is_a_mistake_please_contact_our_customer_relations_team:MAi,learn_more:$Ai,contact_us:LAi,