:zNi,record_sightings:INi,sketchdescribe_unfamiliar_fish:DNi,demonstrate_environmentally_friendly_diving_practices:ENi,use_reference_materials_to_identify_unfamiliar_fish:jNi,effective_communication_and_light_use:TNi,navigation:xNi,guided_tour:RNi,buoyancy_check:MNi,neutral_buoyancy_during_descent:$Ni,hovering:LNi,fine_tune_with_breath_control:ONi,practice_search_patterns_on_land:NNi,practice_object_rigging_on_land:FNi,small_area_search:qNi,large_area_search:BNi,tie_knots_underwater:VNi,rigging_and_lifting_an_object:HNi,identify_aquatic_plant_life:KNi,identify_and_observe_aquatic_invertebrates:UNi,identify_and_observe_aquatic_vertebrates:GNi,log:WNi,knowledge_review:JNi,briefing_tasks_and_planning:YNi,suiting_up:ZNi,predive_safety_check_bwraf:QNi,navigating_the_wreck:XNi,returning_to_ascent_point:eFi,ascent__safety_stop:aFi,debrief_self_critique_and_performance_assessment:tFi,log_dive__complete_training_record:iFi,adventure_dive_type:nFi,what_adventure_dive_did_you_complete:rFi,select_adventure_dive:oFi,dive_type:sFi,training_dive:lFi,select_course:_Fi,save_:dFi,dive:uFi,scenario_1___unresponsive_diver_underwater:cFi,search_for_and_locate_a_missing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation_demonstrate:mFi,\"1_interviewing_the_victims_buddy_and_drawing_logical_conclusions_from_the_information_presented\":\"1. Menemu bual rakan selam mangsa dan membuat kesimpulan yang logik dari informasi yang diberikan.\",\"2_organizing_a_quick_and_effective_search_using_surface_and_underwater_search_patterns\":\"2. Mengatur pencarian yang cepat dan efektif (menggunakan corak pencarian di permukaan dan dalam air).\",\"3_searching_for_and_locating_a_missing_diver\":\"3. Mencari dan mengesan seorang penyelam yang hilang.\",\"4_bringing_a_diver_simulating_unresponsiveness_to_the_surface_using_controlled_positive_buoyancy\":\"4. Membawa penyelam yang mensimulasikan tidak responsif naik ke permukaan dengan menggunakan keapungan positif secara terkawal.\",scenario_2___unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:gFi,demonstrate:pFi,\"1_effectively_responding_to_an_unresponsive_nonbreathing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation\":\"1. Memberi respon terhadap seorang penyelam tidak responsif, yang tidak bernafas dalam satu simulasi kemalangan.\",\"2_evaluation_tow_inwater_rescue_breathing_removing_equipment_exiting_and_providing_cpr\":\"2. Menilai, menunda, memberikan bantuan pernafasan dalam air, menanggalkan peralatan, keluar dari air dan memberi CPR.\",note_either_use_a_cpr_mannequin_or_simulate_compressions_for_cpr:hFi,exercise_1_tired_diver:fFi,exercise_2_panicked_diver:vFi,exercise_3_response_from_shore_boat_or_dock_responsive_diver:yFi,exercise_4_distressed_diver_underwater:bFi,exercise_5_missing_diver:kFi,exercise_6_surfacing_the_unresponsive_diver:wFi,exercise_7_unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:PFi,exercise_8_exiting_the_unresponsive_diver:SFi,exercise_9_first_aid_for_pressure_related_injuries_and_oxygen_administration:AFi,exercise_10_response_from_shoreboat_unresponsive_diver:CFi,notifications:zFi,today:IFi,older:DFi,ocean_conservation:EFi,support:jFi,performance:TFi,tools:xFi,padi_pro:RFi,padi_club:MFi,discover_scuba_diving:$Fi,or:LFi,and:OFi,print:NFi,date_format:FFi,rev:qFi,version:BFi,ecards:VFi,tap_any_card_to_view_details:HFi,you_dont_have_any_ecards_attached_to_your_account_at_this_time:KFi,buy_cert_card:UFi,no_padi_program_found:GFi,take_the_plunge_with_one_of_our_entry_level_programs_for_scuba_diving_freediving_or_mermaid_if_you_think_this_is_a_mistake_please_contact_our_customer_relations_team:WFi,learn_more:JFi,contact_us:YFi,check_out_our_entry_level_courses:ZFi,sort_by:QFi,name_a_z:XFi,name_z_a:eqi,most_popular:aqi,price_low_to_high:tqi,price_high_to_low:iqi,certifications_with_no_ecards:nqi,no_certifications_found:rqi,no_additional_certifications_without_ecards:oqi,view_all:sqi,all_ecards:lqi,assisted_equipment_preparation_donning_and_adjustment:_qi,breathing_and_equalization_techniques:dqi,courses:uqi,total_dive_time:cqi,location:mqi,dive_date:g