:M3n,card_number:$3n,expiration_date_mm_yy:L3n,cancel:O3n,first_payment:N3n,second_payment:F3n,donation:q3n,renewal_fee:B3n,save_my_changes:V3n,remove_donation:H3n,enroll_in_auto_renewal:K3n,please_enter_a_valid_amount:U3n,please_enter_a_valid_expiration_date:G3n,enter_a_valid_card_number:W3n,please_enter_name_on_card:J3n,draft:Y3n,pending:Z3n,resubmit:Q3n,verified:X3n,\"2022_padi_member_renewal_pricing_will_be_published_in_fall_2021_youll_have_the_option_to_update_your_renewal_selection_after_pricing_is_published\":\"Ceny za odnowienie członkostwa na rok 2022 zostaną opublikowane na jesieni 2021. Po ich opublikowaniu będziesz mieć możliwość uaktualnienia informacji w swojej sekcji odnowienia członkostwa.\",file_size_limit:e4n,select_file:a4n,retry_upload:t4n,save:i4n,are_you_sure_you_want_to_delete_this_photo:n4n,delete_photo:r4n,edit_photo:o4n,completion_date:s4n,reactivate_date:l4n,padi_no:_4n,instructor:d4n,address:u4n,phone:c4n,name:m4n,qualifications:g4n,shop:p4n,savings:h4n,auto_renewal:f4n,auto_renewal_payment_plan:v4n,one_time_renewal:y4n,add_new_user:b4n,username:k4n,first_name:w4n,last_name:P4n,role:S4n,action:A4n,deactivate:C4n,edit:z4n,active:I4n,inactive:D4n,rows_per_page:E4n,password:j4n,email:T4n,optional:x4n,renew_now:R4n,status:M4n,in_progress:$4n,processed:L4n,processing_failed:O4n,participant_name:N4n,forms:F4n,completed:q4n,bulk_process_selected:B4n,download_selected:V4n,participant:H4n,e_learning:K4n,dive_pro:U4n,details:G4n,view:W4n,reload:J4n,text_trouble_loading_data:Y4n,showing_pagination_label:Z4n,program:Q4n,from:X4n,date:e5n,signed:a5n,complete:t5n,all:i5n,new:\"Nowe\",empty_table_text:n5n,limitations:r5n,birth_date:o5n,certification_card:s5n,card_type:l5n,card_back:_5n,format:d5n,padi_club_45_day_trial:u5n,free_trial:c5n,padi_club_membership_includes_exclusive_discounts_on_dive_courses_travel_an_annual_subscription_to_scuba_diving_magazine_and_more_if_you_are_in_the_us_provide_your_shipping_address_to_receive_your_paper_copy_of_the_maga