eutral_buoyancy_during_descent:kAn,hovering:wAn,fine_tune_with_breath_control:PAn,practice_search_patterns_on_land:SAn,practice_object_rigging_on_land:AAn,small_area_search:CAn,large_area_search:zAn,tie_knots_underwater:IAn,rigging_and_lifting_an_object:DAn,identify_aquatic_plant_life:EAn,identify_and_observe_aquatic_invertebrates:jAn,identify_and_observe_aquatic_vertebrates:TAn,log:xAn,knowledge_review:RAn,briefing_tasks_and_planning:MAn,suiting_up:$An,predive_safety_check_bwraf:LAn,navigating_the_wreck:OAn,returning_to_ascent_point:NAn,ascent__safety_stop:FAn,debrief_self_critique_and_performance_assessment:qAn,log_dive__complete_training_record:BAn,adventure_dive_type:VAn,what_adventure_dive_did_you_complete:HAn,select_adventure_dive:KAn,dive_type:UAn,training_dive:GAn,select_course:WAn,save_:JAn,dive:YAn,scenario_1___unresponsive_diver_underwater:ZAn,search_for_and_locate_a_missing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation_demonstrate:QAn,\"1_interviewing_the_victims_buddy_and_drawing_logical_conclusions_from_the_information_presented\":\"1. Zadawanie pytań partnerowi zaginionego nurka i wyciąganie logicznych wniosków z otrzymanych informacji.\",\"2_organizing_a_quick_and_effective_search_using_surface_and_underwater_search_patterns\":\"2. Zorganizowanie sprawnej i efektywnej akcji poszukiwawczej (wykorzystując schematy poszukiwawcze na powierzchni i pod wodą).\",\"3_searching_for_and_locating_a_missing_diver\":\"3. Poszukiwanie i odnalezienie zaginionego nurka.\",\"4_bringing_a_diver_simulating_unresponsiveness_to_the_surface_using_controlled_positive_buoyancy\":\"4. Wydobycie na powierzchnię nurka symulującego brak reakcji wykorzystując kontrolowaną pływalność dodatnią.\",scenario_2___unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:XAn,demonstrate:eCn,\"1_effectively_responding_to_an_unresponsive_nonbreathing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation\":\"Zademonstrować:1. Efektywną reakcję w przypadku niereagującego, nieoddychającego nurka podczas symulacji wypadku nurkowego.\",\"2_evaluation_tow_inwater_rescue_breathing_removing_equipment_exiting_and_providing_cpr\":\"2. Dokonanie oceny, holowanie poszkodowanego, podanie oddechów ratowniczych w wodzie, zdjęcie sprzętu, wyjście z wody i wykonanie resuscytacji (RKO).\",note_either_use_a_cpr_mannequin_or_simulate_compressions_for_cpr:aCn,exercise_1_tired_diver:tCn,exercise_2_panicked_diver:iCn,exercise_3_response_from_shore_boat_or_dock_responsive_diver:nCn,exercise_4_distressed_diver_underwater:rCn,exercise_5_missing_diver:oCn,exercise_6_surfacing_the_unresponsive_diver:sCn,exercise_7_unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:lCn,exercise_8_exiting_the_unresponsive_diver:_Cn,exercise_9_first_aid_for_pressure_related_injuries_and_oxygen_administration:dCn,exercise_10_response_from_shoreboat_unresponsive_diver:uCn,notifications:cCn,today:mCn,older:gCn,ocean_conservation:pCn,support:hCn,performance:fCn,tools:vCn,padi_pro:yCn,padi_club:bCn,discover_scuba_diving:kCn,or:wCn,and:PCn,print:SCn,date_format:ACn,rev:CCn,version:zCn,ecards:ICn,tap_any_card_to_view_details:DCn,you_dont_have_any_ecards_attached_to_your_account_at_this_time:ECn,buy_cert_card:jCn,no_padi_program_found:TCn,take_the_plunge_with_one_of_our_entry_level_programs_for_scuba_diving_freediving_or_mermaid_if_you_think_this_is_a_mistake_please_contact_our_customer_relations_team:xCn,learn_more:RCn,contact_us:MCn,check_out_our_entry_level_courses:$Cn,sort_by:LCn,name_a_z:OCn,name_z_a:NCn,most_popular:FCn,price_low_to_high:qCn,price_high_to_low:BCn,certifications_with_no_ecards:VCn,no_certifications_found:HCn,no_additional_certifications_without_ecards:KCn,view_all:UCn,all_ecards:GCn,assisted_equipment_preparation_donning_and_adjustment:WCn,breathing_and_equalization_techniques:JCn,courses:YCn,total_dive_time:ZCn,location:QCn,dive_date:XCn,upload_a_photo:e9n,advanced_open_water:a9n,rescue_diver:t9n,reactivate:i9n,previous:n9n,trimix:r9n,selected_date_outside_range:o9n,qr_code_verified:s9n,optional_field:l9n,important:_9n,please_make_sure_your_informa