y:Tvr,boat_diving_exit:xvr,stow_equipment:Rvr,camera_system_setup:Mvr,still_and_video_imaging:$vr,drift_dive:Lvr,buoyancy_check_with_dry_suit:Ovr,neutral_buoyancy:Nvr,dry_suit_dive:Fvr,scuba_unit_and_weight_system_remove_and_replacement_at_surface:qvr,slate_preparation:Bvr,observe_and_identify_fish_families:Vvr,record_sightings:Hvr,sketchdescribe_unfamiliar_fish:Kvr,demonstrate_environmentally_friendly_diving_practices:Uvr,use_reference_materials_to_identify_unfamiliar_fish:Gvr,effective_communication_and_light_use:Wvr,navigation:Jvr,guided_tour:Yvr,buoyancy_check:Zvr,neutral_buoyancy_during_descent:Qvr,hovering:Xvr,fine_tune_with_breath_control:eyr,practice_search_patterns_on_land:ayr,practice_object_rigging_on_land:tyr,small_area_search:iyr,large_area_search:nyr,tie_knots_underwater:ryr,rigging_and_lifting_an_object:oyr,identify_aquatic_plant_life:syr,identify_and_observe_aquatic_invertebrates:lyr,identify_and_observe_aquatic_vertebrates:_yr,log:dyr,knowledge_review:uyr,briefing_tasks_and_planning:cyr,suiting_up:myr,predive_safety_check_bwraf:gyr,navigating_the_wreck:pyr,returning_to_ascent_point:hyr,ascent__safety_stop:fyr,debrief_self_critique_and_performance_assessment:vyr,log_dive__complete_training_record:yyr,adventure_dive_type:byr,what_adventure_dive_did_you_complete:kyr,select_adventure_dive:wyr,dive_type:Pyr,training_dive:Syr,select_course:Ayr,save_:Cyr,dive:zyr,scenario_1___unresponsive_diver_underwater:Iyr,search_for_and_locate_a_missing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation_demonstrate:Dyr,\"1_interviewing_the_victims_buddy_and_drawing_logical_conclusions_from_the_information_presented\":\"1. Опрос напарника пострадавшего и принятие логичных решений на основе имеющейся информации.\",\"2_organizing_a_quick_and_effective_search_using_surface_and_underwater_search_patterns\":\"2. Организация быстрого и эффективного поиска (с использованием приемов поиска на поверхности и под водой).\",\"3_searching_for_and_locating_a_missing_diver\":\"3. Поиск и обнаружение пропавшего дайвера.\",\"4_bringing_a_diver_simulating_unresponsiveness_to_the_surface_using_controlled_positive_buoyancy\":\"4. Подъем дайвера, имитирующего бессознательное состояние, на поверхность с использованием контролируемой положительной плавучести.\",scenario_2___unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:Eyr,demonstrate:jyr,\"1_effectively_responding_to_an_unresponsive_nonbreathing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation\":\"1. Оказание эффективной помощи недышащему бессознательному дайверу во время имитации несчастного случая.\",\"2_evaluation_tow_inwater_rescue_breathing_removing_equipment_exiting_and_providing_cpr\":\"2. Выполнение оценки ситуации, буксировку, искусственное дыхание на поверхности, снятие снаряжения, выход из воды и проведение сердечно-легочной реанимации.\",note_either_use_a_cpr_mannequin_or_simulate_compressions_for_cpr:Tyr,exercise_1_tired_diver:xyr,exercise_2_panicked_diver:Ryr,exercise_3_response_from_shore_boat_or_dock_responsive_diver:Myr,exercise_4_distressed_diver_underwater:$yr,exercise_5_missing_diver:Lyr,exercise_6_surfacing_the_unresponsive_diver:Oyr,exercise_7_unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:Nyr,exercise_8_exiting_the_unresponsive_diver:Fyr,exercise_9_first_aid_for_pressure_related_injuries_and_oxygen_administration:qyr,exercise_10_response_from_shoreboat_unresponsive_diver:Byr,notifications:Vyr,today:Hyr,older:Kyr,ocean_conservation:Uyr,support:Gyr,performance:Wyr,tools:Jyr,padi_pro:Yyr,padi_club:Zyr,discover_scuba_diving:Qyr,or:Xyr,and:e1r,print:a1r,date_format:t1r,rev:i1r,version:n1r,ecards:r1r,tap_any_card_to_view_details:o1r,you_dont_have_any_ecards_attached_to_your_account_at_this_time:s1r,buy_cert_card:l1r,no_padi_program_found:_1r,take_the_plunge_with_one_of_our_entry_level_programs_for_scuba_diving_freediving_or_mermaid_if_you_think_this_is_a_mistake_please_contact_our_customer_relations_team:d1r,learn_more:u1r,contact_us:c1r,check_out_our_entry_level_courses:m1r,sort_by:g1r,name_a_z:p1r,name_z_a:h1r,most_popular:f1r,price_lo