ore_you_forget_them_this_is_optional_and_you_can_come_back_and_do_it_any_time:eFr,go_to_logbook:aFr,log_dive:tFr,save_to_drafts:iFr,submit_for_verification:nFr,delete:\"ลบ\",select_course_and_training_dive_number:rFr,select_training_dive:oFr,open_water_diver:sFr,open_water_training_dive_1:lFr,open_water_training_dive_2:_Fr,open_water_training_dive_3:dFr,open_water_training_dive_4:uFr,you_have_logged_all_training_dives_for_this_course:cFr,view_all_courses:mFr,enter_a_title:gFr,enter_a_location:pFr,enter_a_date:hFr,select_a_dive_type:fFr,enter_an_instructor:vFr,invalid_instructor_number:yFr,required_fields_missing_in:bFr,general_and_depth_time:kFr,general_and_training_dive_skills:wFr,depth_time_and_training_dive_skills:PFr,general_depth_time_and_training_dive_skills:SFr,enter_a_max_depth:AFr,enter_a_bottom_time:CFr,buoyancy_control_oral_inflation:zFr,plan_dive_using_slate:IFr,free_descent_without_reference_avoid_contact:DFr,safety_stop:EFr,select_at_least_1_skill:jFr,are_you_ready_to_send_to:TFr,m:xFr,quarry:RFr,cloudy:MFr,what_kind_of_gas_did_you_use:$Fr,total_dives:LFr,dive_time:OFr,conditions:NFr,kg:FFr,continue_logging:qFr,instructor_submission:BFr,loading_your_logged_dives:VFr,photos:HFr,what_did_you_see_during_your_dive:KFr,jpg_png_10mb_maximum_per_photo:UFr,assembling_and_positioning_emergency_equipment:GFr,describe_and_record_color_changes_at_depth:WFr,dive_computerdepth_gauge_comparisons:JFr,compass_use_on_land:YFr,distance_swim:ZFr,time_estimation_swim:QFr,navigate_a_straight_line_and_its_reciprocal_using_natural_navigation:XFr,navigate_a_straight_line_and_its_reciprocal_using_a_compass:eqr,navigate_a_square_pattern_using_a_compass:aqr,boat_diving_entry:tqr,navigate_from_and_back_to_boat:iqr,deploy_surface_marker_buoy:nqr,boat_diving_exit:rqr,stow_equipment:oqr,camera_system_setup:sqr,still_and_video_imaging:lqr,drift_dive:_qr,buoyancy_check_with_dry_suit:dqr,neutral_buoyancy:uqr,dry_suit_dive:cqr,scuba_unit_and_weight_system_remove_and_replacement_at_surface:mqr,slate_preparation:gqr,observe_and_identify_fish_families:pqr,record_sightings:hqr,sketchdescribe_unfamiliar_fish:fqr,demonstrate_environmentally_friendly_diving_practices:vqr,use_reference_materials_to_identify_unfamiliar_fish:yqr,effective_communication_and_light_use:bqr,navigation:kqr,guided_tour:wqr,buoyancy_check:Pqr,neutral_buoyancy_during_descent:Sqr,hovering:Aqr,fine_tune_with_breath_control:Cqr,practice_search_patterns_on_land:zqr,practice_object_rigging_on_land:Iqr,small_area_search:Dqr,large_area_search:Eqr,tie_knots_underwater:jqr,rigging_and_lifting_an_object:Tqr,identify_aquatic_plant_life:xqr,identify_and_observe_aquatic_invertebrates:Rqr,identify_and_observe_aquatic_vertebrates:Mqr,log:$qr,knowledge_review:Lqr,briefing_tasks_and_planning:Oqr,suiting_up:Nqr,predive_safety_check_bwraf:Fqr,navigating_the_wreck:qqr,returning_to_ascent_point:Bqr,ascent__safety_stop:Vqr,debrief_self_critique_and_performance_assessment:Hqr,log_dive__complete_training_record:Kqr,adventure_dive_type:Uqr,what_adventure_dive_did_you_complete:Gqr,select_adventure_dive:Wqr,dive_type:Jqr,training_dive:Yqr,select_course:Zqr,save_:Qqr,dive:Xqr,scenario_1___unresponsive_diver_underwater:eBr,search_for_and_locate_a_missing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation_demonstrate:aBr,\"1_interviewing_the_victims_buddy_and_drawing_logical_conclusions_from_the_information_presented\":\"1. สอบถามบัดดี้ของผู้ประสบภัยและรวบรวมความจริงจากการสอบถามที่ได้มาขณะนั้น\",\"2_organizing_a_quick_and_effective_search_using_surface_and_underwater_search_patterns\":\"2. ให้จัดการค้นหาอย่างรวดเร็วและมีประสิทธิภาพ (ใช้รูปแบบการค้นหาบนผิวน้ำและใต้น้ำ)\",\"3_searching_for_and_locating_a_missing_diver\":\"3. ค้นหาและบอกตำแหน่งของนักดำน้ำที่หายไป\",\"4_bringing_a_diver_simulating_unresponsiveness_to_the_surface_using_controlled_positive_buoyancy\":\"4. ให้นำนักดำน้ำที่แกล้งหมดสติขึ้นมาบนผิวน้ำโดยใช้การควบคุมการลอยตัวเป็นบวก\",scenario_2___unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:tBr,demonstrate:iBr,\"1_effectively_responding_to_an_unresponsive_nonbreathing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation\":\"1. แสดงการช่วยนักดำน้ำที่หมดสติไม่หายใจในระหว่างอุบัติเหตุอย่างมีประสิทธิภาพ\",\"2_evaluation_tow_inwater_rescue_breathing_removing_equipment_exiting_and_providing_cpr\":\"2. ทำการประเมิน ลาก ทำการเป่าช่วยหายใจ (Rescue Breathing) ในน้ำ ถอดอุปกรณ์ดำน้ำ แล้วนำเอาขึ้นจากน้ำและทำ CPR\",note_either_use_a_cpr_mannequin_or_simulate_compressions_for_cpr:nBr,exercise_1_tired_diver:rBr,exercise_2_panicked_diver:oBr,exercise_3_response_from_shore_boat_or_dock_responsive_diver:sBr,exercise_4_distressed_diver_underwater:lBr,exercise_5_missing_diver:_Br,exercise_6_surfacing_the_unresponsive_diver:dBr,exercise_7_unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:uBr,exercise_8_exiting_the_unresponsive_diver:cBr,exercise_9_first_aid_for_pressure_related_injuries_and_oxygen_administration:mBr,exercise_10_response_from_shoreboat_unresponsive_diver:gBr,notifications:pBr,today:hBr,older:fBr,ocean_conservation:vBr,support:yBr,performance:bBr,tools:kBr,padi_pro:wBr,padi_club:PBr,discover_scuba_diving:SBr,or:ABr,and:CBr,print:zBr,date_format:IBr,rev:DBr,version:EBr,ecards:jBr,tap_any_card_to_view_details:TBr,you_dont_have_any_ecards_attached_to_your_account_at_this_time:xBr,buy_cert_card:RBr,no_padi_program_found:MBr,take_the_plunge_with_one_of_our_entry_level_programs_for_scuba_diving_freediving_or_mermaid_if_you_think_this_is_a_mistake_please_contact_our_customer_relations_team:$Br,learn_more:LBr,contact_us:OBr,check_out_our_entry_level_courses:NBr,sort_by:FBr,name_a_z:qBr,name_z_a:BBr,most_popular:VBr,price_low_to_high:HBr,price_high_to_low:KBr,certifications_with_no_ecards:UBr,no_certifications_found:GBr,no_additional_certifications_without_ecards:WBr,view_all:JBr,all_ecards:YBr,assisted_equipment_preparation_donning_and_adjustment:ZBr,breathing_and_equalization_techniques:QBr,courses:XBr,total_dive_time:eVr,location:aVr,dive_date:tVr,upload_a_photo:iVr,advanced_open_water:nVr,rescue_diver:rVr,reactivate:oVr,previous:sVr,tri