,still_and_video_imaging:kio,drift_dive:wio,buoyancy_check_with_dry_suit:Pio,neutral_buoyancy:Sio,dry_suit_dive:Aio,scuba_unit_and_weight_system_remove_and_replacement_at_surface:Cio,slate_preparation:zio,observe_and_identify_fish_families:Iio,record_sightings:Dio,sketchdescribe_unfamiliar_fish:Eio,demonstrate_environmentally_friendly_diving_practices:jio,use_reference_materials_to_identify_unfamiliar_fish:Tio,effective_communication_and_light_use:xio,navigation:Rio,guided_tour:Mio,buoyancy_check:$io,neutral_buoyancy_during_descent:Lio,hovering:Oio,fine_tune_with_breath_control:Nio,practice_search_patterns_on_land:Fio,practice_object_rigging_on_land:qio,small_area_search:Bio,large_area_search:Vio,tie_knots_underwater:Hio,rigging_and_lifting_an_object:Kio,identify_aquatic_plant_life:Uio,identify_and_observe_aquatic_invertebrates:Gio,identify_and_observe_aquatic_vertebrates:Wio,log:Jio,knowledge_review:Yio,briefing_tasks_and_planning:Zio,suiting_up:Qio,predive_safety_check_bwraf:Xio,navigating_the_wreck:eno,returning_to_ascent_point:ano,ascent__safety_stop:tno,debrief_self_critique_and_performance_assessment:ino,log_dive__complete_training_record:nno,adventure_dive_type:rno,what_adventure_dive_did_you_complete:ono,select_adventure_dive:sno,dive_type:lno,training_dive:_no,select_course:dno,save_:uno,dive:cno,scenario_1___unresponsive_diver_underwater:mno,search_for_and_locate_a_missing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation_demonstrate:gno,\"1_interviewing_the_victims_buddy_and_drawing_logical_conclusions_from_the_information_presented\":\"1. Ang pakikipanayam sa buddy ng biktima at humantong ng mga makatwirang pasyahin mula sa impormasyong nakalap.\",\"2_organizing_a_quick_and_effective_search_using_surface_and_underwater_search_patterns\":\"2. Pagsasayos ng mabilis at mabisang paghahanap (gamit ang mga parisan ng paghahanap sa ibabaw at ilalim ng tubig).\",\"3_searching_for_and_locating_a_missing_diver\":\"3. Paghahanap at pagtatagpo ng nawawalang diver.\",\"4_bringing_a_diver_simulating_unresponsiveness_to_the_surface_using_controlled_positive_buoyancy\":\"4. Pagdadala ng diver na kunwa'y hindi tumutugon sa ibabaw gamit ang kontroladong positive buoyancy.\",scenario_2___unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:pno,demonstrate:hno,\"1_effectively_responding_to_an_unresponsive_nonbreathing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation\":\"1. Mabisang pagtutugon sa isang hindi tumutugon, hindi humihinga na diver habang kunwa'y naaksidente.\",\"2_evaluation_tow_inwater_rescue_breathing_removing_equipment_exiting_and_providing_cpr\":\"2. Pagsusuri, paghila, pagbigay ng paghingang pang-kaligtasan sa tubig, pag-alis ng kagamitan, pagahon at pagbibigay ng CPR.\",note_either_use_a_cpr_mannequin_or_simulate_compressions_for_cpr:fno,exercise_1_tired_diver:vno,exercise_2_panicked_diver:yno,exercise_3_response_from_shore_boat_or_dock_responsive_diver:bno,exercise_4_distressed_diver_underwater:kno,exercise_5_missing_diver:wno,exercise_6_surfacing_the_unresponsive_diver:Pno,exercise_7_unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:Sno,exercise_8_exiting_the_unresponsive_diver:Ano,exercise_9_first_aid_for_pressure_related_injuries_and_oxygen_administration:Cno,exercise_10_response_from_shoreboat_unresponsive_diver:zno,notifications:Ino,today:Dno,older:Eno,ocean_conservation:jno,support:Tno,performance:xno,tools:Rno,padi_pro:Mno,padi_club:$no,discover_scuba_diving:Lno,or:Ono,and:Nno,print:Fno,date_format:qno,rev:Bno,version:Vno,ecards:Hno,tap_any_card_to_view_details:Kno,you_dont_have_any_ecards_attached_to_your_account_at_this_time:Uno,buy_cert_card:Gno,no_padi_program_found:Wno,take_the_plunge_with_one_of_our_entry_level_programs_for_scuba_diving_freediving_or_mermaid_if_you_think_this_is_a_mistake_please_contact_our_customer_relations_team:Jno,learn_more:Yno,contact_us:Zno,check_out_our_entry_level_courses:Qno,sort_by:Xno,name_a_z:ero,name_z_a:aro,most_popular:tro,price_low_to_high:iro,price_high_to_low:nro,certifications_with_no_ecards:rro,no_certifications_found:oro,no_a