d if you want a PADI Pro to verify your dive\",Zzo=\"Important\",Qzo=\"Please make sure your information is current.  You <b>must</b> have a photo uploaded to your profile or you will not be able to receive your eCard.  To update your information and upload a current photo, please go to your  <a href='/profile' target='_blank' class='profile-link'>Profile</a>.\",Xzo=\"Middle Initial\",eIo=\"A PADI eCard<sup>TM</sup> is included with no additional fee.\",aIo=\"Your Instructor made a donation to support conservation with a PADI AWARE eCard<sup>TM</sup>. The donation will go directly to support PADI Dive Centers and Resorts local efforts to keep coral reefs healthy, protect sharks, reduce marine debris and address climate change.\",tIo=\"Submit Application\",iIo=\"I agree this is my signature\",nIo=\"全名\",rIo=\"输入姓名\",oIo=\"手写签名\",sIo=\"PADI Center\",lIo=\"Responsible for payment\",_Io=\"Application Fee\",dIo=\"For an additional {currency} 10 you can support conservation with a PADI AWARE eCard<sup>TM</sup>.  The card fee and any additional donation will go directly to support PADI Centers local efforts to keep coral reefs healthy, protect sharks, reduce marine debris and address climate change.\",uIo=\"Optional Additional Donation\",cIo=\"Upgrade to a PADI AWARE eCard\",mIo=\"donation required\",gIo=\"Application fee paid by\",pIo=\"Note that the application fee covers new member/membership-level processing. Once certified, complimentary membership benefits are extended to the end of this calendar year. To continue your membership next year and onwards, you must renew annually.\",hIo=\"Sign up for Auto Renewal to ensure no lapse in your membership or benefits and receive the lowest membership rate!\",fIo=\"Yes, sign me up for Auto Renewal. I have read and agree to the\",vIo=\"PADI Auto Renewal Agreement\",yIo=\"in its entirely\",bIo=\"Saved Payment Method\",kIo=\"Paid by: \",wIo=\"签名（或如果是未成年人，则需要父母/监护人签名）\",PIo=\"签名 \",SIo=\"Prerequisites must be PADI certifications or qualifying certifications from another organization.\",AIo=\"More information\",CIo=\"You will be required to show proof of certification to your Instructor\",zIo=\"Certification Completion\",IIo=\"Course Completion Date\",DIo=\"签证教练\",EIo=\"Candidate\",jIo=\"AWARE eCard Fee\",TIo=\"PADI AWARE eCard Fee\",xIo=\"Sign up for Auto Renewal\",RIo=\"PADI AWARE Donation\",MIo=\"Credit Card\",$Io=\"PADI will email you a secure payment link once the application has been processed.\",LIo=\"Wire transfer\",OIo=\"PADI Customer Relations will contact you with wire instructions once the application has been processed.\",NIo=\"PayPal\",FIo=\"PADI Customer Relations will contact you with PayPal instructions once the application has been processed.\",qIo=\"Other payment method\",BIo=\"PADI Customer Relations will contact you for further information once the application has been processed.\",VIo=\"Please tell us the payment method you are requesting. Do not enter sensitive bank account information. (Maximum 300 characters)\",HIo=\"Message\",KIo=\"Have logged at least 40 scuba dives\",UIo=\"Be medically evaluated and cleared for diving by a physician within the past 12 months\",GIo=\"A EFR eCard<sup>TM</sup> is included with no additional fee.\",WIo=\"Instructor Agreement\",JIo=\"I have obtained the required current EFR Instructor materials and have made myself familiar with the contents.  I understand I cannot conduct any Emergency First Response (EFR) courses until I receive authorization from EFR.  I further agree that when conducting EFR courses I will abide by all EFR Standards and procedures as published and updated by EFR.  I will maintain familiarity with EFR educational materials, including revisions to existing materials and the introduction of new materials.  I affirm that I have read and will abide with the EFR License Agreement found in the Appendix Section of the EFR Instructor Guide.  I understand and agree that any criminal conviction on my part involving abuse of a minor or sexual abuse of an adult, occurring either during or prior to my certification as an EFR Instructor, will be automatic grounds for denial or revocation of my credential.  I also understand EFR may refuse to accept my application or rescind any EFR Instructor credentials I may have if EFR determines my certification is not in the best interest of Emergency First Response.\",YIo=\"To enroll in an Emergency First Response Instructor course, an individual must:\",ZIo=\"Have completed an EFR Primary and Secondary Care course (or qualifying training) within the past 24 months.\",QIo=\"Be 18 years old.\",XIo=\"Specialty / Distinctive\",eDo=\"Specialty or Distinctive\",aDo=\"What dive did you complete?\",tDo=\"What skills did you complete?\",iDo=\"Please make sure your information is current.  To update your information, please go to your <a href='/profile' target='_blank' class='profile-link'>Profile</a>.\",nDo=\"The total of all gases must be 100%.\",rDo=\"Candidate Information\",oDo=\"I have read the <a target='_blank' href='{membershipAgreementLink}'>Membership Agreement and License Agreement</a> and hereby consent and agree to the terms and conditions in their entirety. I understand and agree that any criminal conviction on my part involving abuse of a minor or sexual abuse of an adult occurring either during or prior to my membership with PADI, will be automatic grounds for denial or termination of my PADI Membership. I hereby certify that all the above statements are true and correct to the best of my knowledge.\",sDo=\"I certify that all prerequisites and certification requirements for the EFR Instructor candidate named herein have been met as outlined in the EFR Instructor Trainer Manual.\",lDo=\"I certify that I have obtained, reviewed and confirmed all underlying (prerequisite) course completions for the EFR Instructor candidate named herein. I further confirm that I will permanently retain copies of such required course completions and any other documents obtained as proof of the candidate’s prerequisites having been met for inspection by PADI/EFR, should PADI/EFR so require.\",_Do=\"I certify that the EFR Instructor candidate named herein has purchased a copy of the EFR Instructor training materials, or that this requirement can be waived per EFR Standards.\",dDo=\"I certify that I have obtained, reviewed and confirmed all underlying (prerequisite) certifications for the Divemaster candidate named herein. I further confirm that I will permanently retain copies of such required certifications and any other documents obtained as proof of the candidate's prerequisites having been met for inspection by PADI, should PADI so require.\",uDo=\"I certify that all prerequisites and certification requirements for the Divemaster candidate named herein have been met as outlined in the PADI Instructor Manual.\",cDo=\"I certify that the Divemaster candidate named herein has purchased a copy of the PADI Divemaster training materials, or that this requirement can be waived per PADI Standards.\",mDo=\"I verify that the Divemaster candidate named herein has 60 logged dives, documenting experience in night diving, deep diving and underwater navigation.\",gDo=\"Candidate Signature\",pDo=\"Payment\",hDo=\"Candidate Prerequisites\",fDo=\"Requires proof of certification beyond entry-level (at least two certifications total); proof of 20 or more logged dives; documented experience in deep diving and underwater navigation.\",vDo=\"Requires proof of certification in diving rescue.\",yDo=\"EFR Primary Care requires proof of CPR training within the last 24 months and EFR Secondary Care requires proof of first-aid training within the last 24 months. Online only courses are not acceptable.\",bDo=\"To meet CPR and first aid requirements for PADI courses, CPR and first aid training must include student skill practice and demonstration of CPR and first aid techniques with a qualified instructor. A course that lacks these, online or via any other medium, does not qualify.\",kDo=\"关闭\",wDo=\"Medical Evaluation\",PDo=\"Minimum Logged Dives\",SDo=\"PADI Emergency First Response Primary and Secondary Care\",ADo=\"PADI Advanced Open Water Diver\",CDo=\"PADI Rescue Diver\",zDo=\"EFR eCard\",IDo=\"PADI AWARE eCard\",DDo=\"Instructor Signature\",EDo=\"Certifying Instructor Signature\",jDo=\"PADI eCard\",TDo={update:bko,remove:kko,mark_as_read:wko,Delete:Pko,january:Sko,february:Ako,march:Cko,april:zko,may:Iko,june:Dko,july:Eko,august:jko,september:Tko,october:xko,november:Rko,december:Mko,day:$ko,month:Lko,year:Oko,afghanistan:Nko,aland_islands:Fko,albania:qko,algeria:Bko,americanSamoa:Vko,andorra:Hko,angola:Kko,anguilla:Uko,antarctica:Gko,antigua_and_barbuda:Wko,argentina:Jko,armenia:Yko,aruba:Zko,australia:Qko,austria:Xko,azerbaijan:e2o,bahamas:a2o,bahrain:t2o,bangladesh:i2o,barbados:n2o,belarus:r2o,belgium:o2o,belize:s2o,benin:l2o,bermuda:_2o,bhutan:d2o,bolivia_plurinational_state_of:u2o,bosnia_and_herzegovina:c2o,botswana:m2o,brazil:g2o,british_indian_ocean_territory:p2o,brunei_darussalam:h2o,bulgaria:f2o,burkina_faso:v2o,burundi:y2o,cambodia:b2o,cameroon:k2o,canada:w2o,cape_verde:P2o,cayman_islands:S2o,central_african_republic:A2o,chad:C2o,chile:z2o,china:I2o,christmas_island:D2o,cocos_keeling_islands:E2o,colombia:j2o,comoros:T2o,congo:x2o,congo_the_democratic_republic_of_the_congo:R2o,cook_islands:M2o,costa_rica:$2o,cote_divoire:L2o,croatia:O2o,cuba:N2o,cyprus:F2o,czech_republic:q2o,denmark:B2o,djibouti:V2o,dominica:H2o,dominican_republic:K2o,ecuador:U2o,egypt:G2o,el_salvador:W2o,equatorial_guinea:J2o,eritrea:Y2o,estonia:Z2o,ethiopia:Q2o,falkland_islands_malvinas:X2o,faroe_islands:ewo,fiji:awo,finland:two,france:iwo,french_guiana:nwo,french_polynesia:rwo,gabon:owo,gambia:swo,georgia:lwo,germany:_wo,ghana:dwo,gibraltar:uwo,greece:cwo,greenland:mwo,grenada:gwo,guadeloupe:pwo,guam:hwo,guatemala:fwo,guernsey:vwo,guinea:ywo,guinea_bissau:bwo,guyana:kwo,haiti:wwo,holy_see_vatican_city_state:Pwo,honduras:Swo,hong_kon