esponsive_nonbreathing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation\":\"1. 在水面救援一位无反应、无呼吸潜水员的有效方法。\",\"2_evaluation_tow_inwater_rescue_breathing_removing_equipment_exiting_and_providing_cpr\":\"2. 评估，拖带，水中救援呼吸，装备脱除，出水，施行 CPR。\",note_either_use_a_cpr_mannequin_or_simulate_compressions_for_cpr:V9o,exercise_1_tired_diver:H9o,exercise_2_panicked_diver:K9o,exercise_3_response_from_shore_boat_or_dock_responsive_diver:U9o,exercise_4_distressed_diver_underwater:G9o,exercise_5_missing_diver:W9o,exercise_6_surfacing_the_unresponsive_diver:J9o,exercise_7_unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:Y9o,exercise_8_exiting_the_unresponsive_diver:Z9o,exercise_9_first_aid_for_pressure_related_injuries_and_oxygen_administration:Q9o,exercise_10_response_from_shoreboat_unresponsive_diver:X9o,notifications:ezo,today:azo,older:tzo,ocean_conservation:izo,support:nzo,performance:rzo,tools:ozo,padi_pro:szo,padi_club:lzo,discover_scuba_diving:_zo,or:dzo,and:uzo,print:czo,date_format:mzo,rev:gzo,version:pzo,ecards:hzo,tap_any_card_to_view_details:fzo,you_dont_have_any_ecards_attached_to_your_account_at_this_time:vzo,buy_cert_card:yzo,no_padi_program_found:bzo,take_the_plunge_with_one_of_our_entry_level_programs_for_scuba_diving_freediving_or_mermaid_if_you_think_this_is_a_mistake_please_contact_our_customer_relations_team:kzo,learn_more:wzo,contact_us:Pzo,check_out_our_entry_level_courses:Szo,sort_by:Azo,name_a_z:Czo,name_z_a:zzo,most_popular:Izo,price_low_to_high:Dzo,price_high_to_low:Ezo,certifications_with_no_ecards:jzo,no_certifications_found:Tzo,no_additional_certifications_without_ecards:xzo,view_all:Rzo,all_ecards:Mzo,assisted_equipment_preparation_donning_and_adjustment:$zo,breathing_and_equalization_techniques:Lzo,courses:Ozo,total_dive_time:Nzo,location:Fzo,dive_date:qzo,upload_a_photo:Bzo,advanced_open_water:Vzo,rescue_diver:Hzo,reactivate:Kzo,previous:Uzo,trimix:Gzo,selected_date_outside_range:Wzo,qr_code_verified:Jzo,optional_field:Yzo,important:Zzo,please_make_sure_your_information_is_current_to_