"工具\",bVo=\"PADI 周邊產品 (An Oceanfirst Marketplace)\",kVo=\"PADI Club\",wVo=\"體驗水肺潛水(DSD)\",PVo=\"或者\",SVo=\"和\",AVo=\"正楷\",CVo=\"日期 （日/月/年）\",zVo=\"Rev\",IVo=\"版本\",DVo=\"電子檢定卡\",EVo=\"點選任意卡片即可查看詳細資訊\",jVo=\"目前您沒有上傳任何電子檢定卡到您的帳戶中。\",TVo=\"購買證書實體卡\",xVo=\"沒有找到 PADI 課程\",RVo=\"參加我們的水肺潛水、自由潛水或美人魚入門級項目之一。 如果您認為這是一個錯誤，請聯繫我們的客戶關係團隊。\",MVo=\"了解更多\",$Vo=\"聯繫我們\",LVo=\"查看我們的入門課程\",OVo=\"分類排序\",NVo=\"姓名(A - Z)\",FVo=\"姓名(Z - A)\",qVo=\"最流行的\",BVo=\"價格：由低至高\",VVo=\"價格：由高至低\",HVo=\"沒有電子卡的認證\",KVo=\"未找到認證\",UVo=\"沒有電子卡就沒有額外的認證。\",GVo=\"查看全部\",WVo=\"所有電子卡\",JVo=\"裝備準備、穿戴和調整\",YVo=\"• 呼吸規則和平衡壓力的技巧\",ZVo=\"課程\",QVo=\"總潛水時間\",XVo=\"地點\",eHo=\"潛水日期\",aHo=\"上传照片\",tHo=\"進階開放水域\",iHo=\"救援潛水員\",nHo=\"ReActivate\",rHo=\"上一頁\",oHo=\"Trimix\",sHo=\"Selected date is outside the allowed range\",lHo=\"QR Code Verified\",_Ho=\"Optional but required if you want a PADI Pro to verify your dive\",dHo=\"Important\",uHo=\"Please make sure your information is current.  You <b>must</b> have a photo uploaded to your profile or you will not be able to receive your eCard.  To update your information and upload a current photo, please go to your  <a href='/profile' target='_blank' class='profile-link'>Profile</a>.\",cHo=\"Middle Initial\",mHo=\"A PADI eCard<sup>TM</sup> is included with no additional fee.\",gHo=\"Your Instructor made a donation to support conservation with a PADI AWARE eCard<sup>TM</sup>. The donation will go directly to support PADI Dive Centers and Resorts local efforts to keep coral reefs healthy, protect sharks, reduce marine debris and address climate change.\",pHo=\"Submit Application\",hHo=\"I agree this is my signature\",fHo=\"全名\",vHo=\"輸入姓名\",yHo=\"手寫簽名\",bHo=\"PADI Center\",kHo=\"Responsible for payment\",wHo=\"Application Fee\",PHo=\"For an additional {currency} 10 you can support conservation with a PADI AWARE eCard<sup>TM</sup>.  The card fee and any additional donation will go directly to support PADI Centers local efforts to keep coral reefs healthy, protect sharks, reduce marine debris and address climate change.\",SHo=\"Optional Additional Donation\",AHo=\"Upgrade to a PADI AWARE eCard\",CHo=\"donation required\",zHo=\"Application fee paid by\",IHo=\"Note that the application fee covers new member/membership-level processing. Once certified, complimentary membership benefits are extended to the end of this calendar year. To continue your membership next year and onwards, you must renew annually.\",DHo=\"Sign up for Auto Renewal to ensure no lapse in your membership or benefits and receive the lowest membership rate!\",EHo=\"Yes, sign me up for Auto Renewal. I have read and agree to the\",jHo=\"PADI Auto Renewal Agreement\",THo=\"in its entirely\",xHo=\"Saved Payment Method\",RHo=\"Paid by: \",MHo=\"簽名(如適用，需要家長或監護人簽名)\",$Ho=\"簽名 \",LHo=\"Prerequisites must be PADI certifications or qualifying certifications from another organization.\",OHo=\"More information\",NHo=\"You will be required to show proof of certification to your Instructor\",FHo=\"Certification Completion\",qHo=\"Course Completion Date\",BHo=\"簽證教練\",VHo=\"Candidate\",HHo=\"AWARE eCard Fee\",KHo=\"PADI AWARE eCard Fee\",UHo=\"Sign up for Auto Renewal\",GHo=\"PADI AWARE Donation\",WHo=\"Credit Card\",JHo=\"PADI will email you a secure payment link once the application has been processed.\",YHo=\"Wire transfer\",ZHo=\"PADI Customer Relations will contact you with wire instructions once the application has been processed.\",QHo=\"PayPal\",XHo=\"PADI Customer Relations will contact you with PayPal instructions once the application has been processed.\",eKo=\"Other payment method\",aKo=\"PADI Customer Relations will contact you for further information once the application has been processed.\",tKo=\"Please tell us the payment method you are requesting. Do not enter sensitive bank account information. (Maximum 300 characters)\",iKo=\"Message\",nKo=\"Have logged at least 40 scuba dives\",rKo=\"Be medically evaluated and cleared for diving by a physician within the past 12 months\",oKo=\"A EFR eCard<sup>TM</sup> is included with no additional fee.\",sKo=\"Instructor Agreement\",lKo=\"I have obtained the required current EFR Instructor materials and have made myself familiar with the contents.  I understand I cannot conduct any Emergency First Response (EFR) courses until I receive authorization from EFR.  I further agree that when conducting EFR courses I will abide by all EFR Standards and procedures as published and updated by EFR.  I will maintain familiarity with EFR educational materials, including revisions to existing materials and the introduction of new materials.  I affirm that I have read and will abide with the EFR License Agreement found in the Appendix Section of the EFR Instructor Guide.  I understand and agree that any criminal conviction on my part involving abuse of a minor or sexual abuse of an adult, occurring either during or prior to my certification as an EFR Instructor, will be automatic grounds for denial or revocation of my credential.  I also understand EFR may refuse to accept my application or rescind any EFR Instructor credentials I may have if EFR determines my certification is not in the best interest of Emergency First Response.\",_Ko=\"To enroll in an Emergency First Response Instructor course, an individual must:\",dKo=\"Have completed an EFR Primary and Secondary Care course (or qualifying training) within the past 24 months.\",uKo=\"Be 18 years old.\",cKo=\"Specialty / Distinctive\",mKo=\"Specialty or Distinctive\",gKo=\"What dive did you complete?\",pKo=\"What skills did you complete?\",hKo=\"Please make sure your information is current.  To update your information, please go to your <a href='/profile' target='_blank' class='profile-link'>Profile</a>.\",fKo=\"The total of all gases must be 100%.\",vKo=\"Candidate Information\",yKo=\"I have read the <a target='_blank' href='{membershipAgreementLink}'>Membership Agreement and License Agreement</a> and hereby consent and agree to the terms and conditions in their entirety. I understand and agree that any criminal conviction on my part involving abuse of a minor or sexual abuse of an adult occurring either during or prior to my membership with PADI, will be automatic grounds for denial or termination of my PADI Membership. I hereby certify that all the above statements are true and correct to the best of my knowledge.\",bKo=\"I certify that all prerequisites and certification requirements for the EFR Instructor candidate named herein have been met as outlined in the EFR Instructor Trainer Manual.\",kKo=\"I certify that I have obtained, reviewed and confirmed all underlying (prerequisite) course completions for the EFR Instructor candidate named herein. I further confirm that I will permanently retain copies of such required course completions and any other documents obtained as proof of the candidate’s prerequisites having been met for inspection by PADI/EFR, should PADI/EFR so require.\",wKo=\"I certify that the EFR Instructor candidate named herein has purchased a copy of the EFR Instructor training materials, or that this requirement can be waived per EFR Standards.\",PKo=\"I certify that I have obtained, reviewed and confirmed all underlying (prerequisite) certifications for the Divemaster candidate named herein. I further confirm that I will permanently retain copies of such required certifications and any other documents obtained as proof of the candidate's prerequisites having been met for inspection by PADI, should PADI so require.\",SKo=\"I certify that all prerequisites and certification requirements for the Divemaster candidate named herein have been met as outlined in the PADI Instructor Manual.\",AKo=\"I certify that the Divemaster candidate named herein has purchased a copy of the PADI Divemaster training materials, or that this requirement can be waived per PADI Standards.\",CKo=\"I verify that the Divemaster candidate named herein has 60 logged dives, documenting experience in night diving, deep diving and underwater navigation.\",zKo=\"Candidate Signature\",IKo=\"Payment\",DKo=\"Candidate Prerequisites\",EKo=\"Requires proof of certification beyond entry-level (at least two certifications total); proof of 20 or more logged dives; documented experience in deep diving and underwater navigation.\",jKo=\"Requires proof of certification in diving rescue.\",TKo=\"EFR Primary Care requires proof of CPR training within the last 24 months and EFR Secondary Care requires proof of first-aid training within the last 24 months. Online only courses are not acceptable.\",xKo=\"To meet CPR and first aid requirements for PADI courses, CPR and first aid training must include student skill practice and demonstration of CPR and first aid techniques with a qualified instructor. A course that lacks these, online or via any other medium, does not qualify.\",RKo=\"關閉\",MKo={update:xDo,remove:RDo,mark_as_read:MDo,Delete:$Do,january:LDo,february:ODo,march:NDo,april:FDo,may:qDo,june:BDo,july:VDo,august:HDo,september:KDo,october:UDo,november:GDo,december:WDo,day:JDo,month:YDo,year:ZDo,afghanistan:QDo,aland_islands:XDo,albania:eEo,algeria:aEo,americanSamoa:tEo,andorra:iEo,angola:nEo,anguilla:rEo,antarctica:oEo,antigua_and_barbuda:sEo,argentina:lEo,armenia:_Eo,aruba:dEo,australia:uEo,austria:cEo,azerbaijan:mEo,bahamas:gEo,bahrain:pEo,bangladesh:hEo,barbados:fEo,belarus:vEo,belgium:yEo,belize:bEo,benin:kEo,bermuda:wEo,bhutan:PEo,bolivia_plurinational_state_of:SEo,bosnia_and_herzegovina:AEo,botswana:CEo,brazil:zEo,british_indian_ocean_territory:IEo,brunei_darussalam:DEo,bulgaria:EEo,burkina_faso:jEo,burundi:TEo,cambodia:xEo,cameroon:REo,canada:MEo,cape_verde:$Eo,cayman_islands:LEo,central_african_republic:OEo,chad:NEo,chile:FEo,china:qEo,christmas_island:BEo,cocos_keeling_islands:VEo,colombia:HEo,comoros:KEo,congo:UEo,congo_the_democratic_republic_of_the_congo:GEo,cook_islands:WEo,costa_rica:JEo,cote_divoire:YEo,croatia:ZEo,cuba:QEo,cyprus:XEo,czech_republic:ejo,denmark:ajo,djibouti:tjo,domini