ons_from_the_information_presented\":\"1. 詢問遇難者的潛伴，並從他所提供的資訊歸納出合乎邏輯的結論。\",\"2_organizing_a_quick_and_effective_search_using_surface_and_underwater_search_patterns\":\"2. 安排一次快速、有效的搜索（利用水面及水底搜索方式）。\",\"3_searching_for_and_locating_a_missing_diver\":\"3. 搜索並找到失蹤潛水員。\",\"4_bringing_a_diver_simulating_unresponsiveness_to_the_surface_using_controlled_positive_buoyancy\":\"4. 利用有控制的正浮力，將那位模擬沒有反應的潛水員帶到水面。\",scenario_2___unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:eVo,demonstrate:aVo,\"1_effectively_responding_to_an_unresponsive_nonbreathing_diver_during_an_accident_simulation\":\"1. 在水面救援一位無反應、無呼吸潛水員的有效方法。\",\"2_evaluation_tow_inwater_rescue_breathing_removing_equipment_exiting_and_providing_cpr\":\"2. 評估，拖帶，水中救援呼吸，裝備脫除，出水，施行 CPR。\",note_either_use_a_cpr_mannequin_or_simulate_compressions_for_cpr:tVo,exercise_1_tired_diver:iVo,exercise_2_panicked_diver:nVo,exercise_3_response_from_shore_boat_or_dock_responsive_diver:rVo,exercise_4_distressed_diver_underwater:oVo,exercise_5_missing_diver:sVo,exercise_6_surfacing_the_unresponsive_diver:lVo,exercise_7_unresponsive_diver_at_the_surface:_Vo,exercise_8_exiting_the_unresponsive_diver:dVo,exercise_9_first_aid_for_pressure_related_injuries_and_oxygen_administration:uVo,exercise_10_response_from_shoreboat_unresponsive_diver:cVo,notifications:mVo,today:gVo,older:pVo,ocean_conservation:hVo,support:fVo,performance:vVo,tools:yVo,padi_pro:bVo,padi_club:kVo,discover_scuba_diving:wVo,or:PVo,and:SVo,print:AVo,date_format:CVo,rev:zVo,version:IVo,ecards:DVo,tap_any_card_to_view_details:EVo,you_dont_have_any_ecards_attached_to_your_account_at_this_time:jVo,buy_cert_card:TVo,no_padi_program_found:xVo,take_the_plunge_with_one_of_our_entry_level_programs_for_scuba_diving_freediving_or_mermaid_if_you_think_this_is_a_mistake_please_contact_our_customer_relations_team:RVo,learn_more:MVo,contact_us:$Vo,check_out_our_entry_level_courses:LVo,sort_by:OVo,name_a_z:NVo,name_z_a:FVo,most_popular:qVo,price_low_to_high:BVo,price_high_to_low:VVo,certifications_with_no_